<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Sawltahte</book>
  <para style="h">Sawltahte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sawltahte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sawltahte</para>
  <para style="mt">Sawltahte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theophilus aw, laibu masa sungah Jesu in a sep le a hilte zosie a kipatcil a kipan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a teelsa sawltahpite tungah Hlagau Siengtho tungtawnin a lah zaw ciengin vantunga a kilahto donga thute ka giel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ thuoh gimna zaw ciengin ni sawmli sung sawltahpite kungah kilah a, teci tampite tawh a nungta tahtah ahina lahin Pasien’ manggam thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate tawh a opton laitahin Jerusalem nuasie loin tua munah Pa’ kamciemna a nga nadingun ama in thu a pie hi. Ama in, “Tami thu keima kung pana na zahsa uh ahi hi,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />azieh pen John in tui tawh mite baptize a, ahi vangin a sawt loin Hlagau Siengtho tawh note ang kibaptize ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate a kikhop ciengun ama kungah, “ Topa aw, Israel-te tunga kumpi’ gam na piehkia ding tuhun a ta amah?” ci-in dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, “Pa in ama’ thuneina tawh a sesa hun le nite note thei ding thu ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin na tung vuah Hlagau Siengtho ang tun ciengin vanglietna na nga ding vua, Jerusalem, Judea, Samaria le leimong dongin ka teci na hi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu a gen zaw, amate in a et laitahun ama kilato a, meiilom khat in a dopto dawh ziehin a kimu thei nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama a kilahto amate in vantung lam a etto laitahun puontuol kang sil pasal ni thakhatin amate kungah a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua tegel in, “Galilee mite aw, bang dinga vantung lam enin ding ngetngut na hi uh ahei? Na kungpan vua vantunga kilato tami Jesu khu vantunga a peito na mu ma bangun ang peikia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jerusalem tawh a kinai, Sabbath ni khat lam ahi Olivet a kici muol panin Jerusalem ah amate a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuopi sung a lut ciengun Peter, John, James, Andrew, Philip le Thomas, Bartholomew le Matthew, Alphaeus’ tapa James, Simon Zealot le James’ tapa Judas-te tunna inndan tungah amate a kato uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate zosie in numei pawlkhat, Jesu’ nu Marry, le a sanggam pasalte tawh lungsim kikhatin thungetna a nei zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua laitahin thu um mite lahah Peter dingto-in, (mihonpi za le sawm ni bang pha hi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Sanggamte aw, Lai Siengtho sungah Jesu a mante’ makai pa Judas tungtang thu tawh kisai-in David’ genkholna a tangtun lo phamaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua Judas khu eite tawh kisimton mi khat ahi a, tam nasepna sunga zong a kihal khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Tu-in tua pa in a gitlona thaman tawh lo khat lei a, ama bungbu kiehin a gilpi pawhkeh a, a gilzam zosie lawtmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jerusalem-a teng zosie in tami thu a thei uhi. Tua logam pen amau’ hamin, ‘Akeldama’ a ci vua, ‘Sisan Lo’ a cinopna ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bangzieh ahei cile Late laibu sungah, A tenna mun gamkhing suohin, khum munah koima teng sih hinlen, a cina le ‘A makai dinmun pen midang khat in luo taheh,’ ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum bang mi dingte pen, eite lahah sungtum pusuohin Topa Jesu a op hun sung zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />John’ baptize-a kipanin vantungah Jesu a kilah dong, ama’ thawkiana thu-ah eite tawh teci a pangton mite lahah khat ahi kul hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in mi ni, Barsabbas le Justus zong a kici Joseph le Matthias a se uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in thu ngenin, “ Topa aw, nangma in mi zosie’ lungsim na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’ opna ding munah Judas pei-in a nuasie tami sawltahpi nasepna-ah panmun a la dingin tam mi nite lahah koi zaw teel na hei ei lah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in lai-ai sanin Matthias tungah tu ahi ziehin sawltahpi sawm le khat lahah ama kigawmbe hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pentecost ni a tun ciengin mun khatah amate a unpi-un a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale vantung panin thakhatin huipi lang tawh kibang aw khat ging a, a tona uh innsung teng zosie a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate lahah meikuong kikhenkeh tawh a kibang leiite kilangin a tung ciet vuah a tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un Hlagau Siengtho tawh a kidim vua, tua Hlagau in a pieh siemna bangin kam tuomtuomte tawh a ham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum laitahin vansin nei-a om gam zosie panin Jerusalem ah Pasien a um Jew mite a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khumi awging ziehin mihonpi a kikhawm vua, thu kigente amau’ pienpi ham cietin a zah ziehun lamdang a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in tam thu lamdang sa-in a lung uh mang a, “Tu-a thugen zosie Galilee mi ahi sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangci dan a i pienpi ham ciet tawh i zah thei uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Parthia gam, Media gam, Elam gam, Mesopotamia gama tengte, Judea gam, Cappadocia gam, Pontus gam le Asia gam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phrygia gam, Pamphylia gam, Egypt gam le Cyrene khuopi-a’ ahi Libya gamkhen sunga tengte le Rome pana a haw mite, Jew mite, le Judah biehna a zuite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Crete mite le Arab mite ahi, Pasien’ nasep lienpite i pienpi ham cietin i za uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi zosie in lamdang sa-in a lungmang vua, “Tami bang a cinopna hi poma ding ahei?” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin pawlkhat in, “Lenggazu tha kham ahi uhi,” ci-in a ehneh ho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin sawm le khatte tawh Peter dingto a, a aw sangsahin amate kungah, “Jew mite le Jerusalem khuo-a tengte aw, tami thu thei unlen ka thugen na ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na upmaw bangun zukham ahi sih uhi, bang ding ahei cile tuhun pen zingmawng nai kuo ahi na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi vawt lo hi, tam pen kamsangpa Joel tungtawnin tam bangin na kigen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Pasien in a genna ah ni tawp ni ciengin mi zosie tungah ka Hlagau ka buo ding a, na tapate ule na tanute un kamsangin, na tangvalte un mang mu ding a, na puvuoite un zong mang a man ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hi hi, khum ni ciengin ka sila pasalte le ka sila numeite tungah ka Hlagau ka buo ding a, amate in kam a sang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tunglam vanah a lamdangte ka lah ding a, neilam leitungah limte, sisan, meikuong le meikhu sapite ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lien a thupi Topa’ ni a tun masangin ni ang miel ding a, hlapi sisan ang bang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ min tawh thu ngen zosie in hutdamna a nga ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“No, Israel-te aw, ka thugen ngai un: Note in na theisa ma bangun Nazareth mi Jesu pen Pasien in note lahah ama tungtawna a bawl vanglietna le na lamdangte, le limte tawh Pasien in a kipsah mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien in ama’ ngimna le a theikholna bangin note khut sungah tam pa ang piekhie a, note in singlamte tungah khai-in migilote’ khut tawh ama na that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin sina in ama tukip zo lo ahi ziehin Pasien in sina panin suohtasahin a thosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama tawh kisai David in a genna-ah, ‘Ka masangah Topa a op den lam ka mu hi, azieh pen ei kilawthing thei lo na dingin ka zietlamah ama a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin ka lungsim kipahin ka leii zong a lungdam hi; tua banah ka tahsa zong lametna sungah a hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen nang in Misikhuo ah ka hla na nuasie sih ding a, na Mi Siengtho pa zong muotna nei thuohsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma in hinna lampi nei lah zo hi; nei ompina tawh kipahna bukim nei bawlpieh ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Sanggam Israel-te aw, pupi David’ si-in kivui zo a, tuni dongin a han zong eite tawh om hi, ci kimuongtahin na kung vuah kang gen thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama kamsang khat ahi a, Pasien in a kumpi topha tungah a suonlehlahte khat ka tosah ding hi, ci-in a kiciem lam ama in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam thu a mukhol ziehin David in Messiah’ thawkiana thu a genna-ah, ‘Misikhuo ah ama kinuasie loin, a pumpi zong muot lo ding hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pasien in tua Jesu thosah zo a, tami thu-ah kote zosie teci ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Pasien’ zietlamah ama kilamsang zo a, note in Pa tung panin a kikamciemsa Hlagau Siengtho zong na sang zo ta vua, note in na mu uleh na zah uh ahi tami zong khu ama in ang buohsuh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile vantungah David a kato sih a, ahi vangin ama in, “ Topa in ka Topa kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />na keng ngahna munah na galte ka koi masangsie ka zietlamah to in,’ ci hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note in na khailia uh tua Jesu, Pasien in Topa le Messiah a suohsah zo ta hi, ci thu Israel innkuon buppi in teltahin thei ta uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in tam thu a zah ciengun a lungsim uh sukha a, Peter le adang sawltahpite kungah, “Sanggamte aw, bang ka bawl ding vuoi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Peter in amate kungah, “Kisiakia unlen na mawnate uh a mai thei nadingin Jesu Khris’ min tawh ki-baptize un; tua hile note in Pasien’ letsong ahi Hlagau Siengtho na nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tua kamciem pen note, na suonlehlahte ule Topa i Pasien in ama kunga a hlat gamlapi-a om mi zosie ading ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuale Peter in adang thu kiselna tampi tawh teci pangin, “Tami a gilo khang mite panin kihunkhie un,” ci-in amate a hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuaci’n a thugenna a um mite a kibaptize vua, khum ni-in mi tul thum bang kibelap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in sawltahpite’ thuhilna le kipawltonna ah a lunglut ciet vua, tuale khomun phalsuona le thungetna a neiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi zosie a zausi vua, sawltahpite in na lamdangte le lim tampi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Thu um zosie omtonin na vannuoi a neiton uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />amate in amau’ neisate le vante zua-in mi khatpo’ kisapna zui-in tua sumte a hawmpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate in biehinnpi sungah nisimin hun tampitah zangtonin, inn ah khomun a phalsuo vua, kipahna le kiphalna lungsim tawh an a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ min phatin mite’ maipha zong a nga uhi. Pasien in nisimin gupna nga mi a kibelapsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat, nitah lam nai thum thunget hunin biehinnpi ah Peter le John-te a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale a pienpi khelbai khat na kipuo hi. Tua pa in biehinn kai mite tung panin sum a nget thei nadingin mite in Kotpi Hoi kici biehinn tunkot gei-ah nisielin ama a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biehinnpi sungah Peter le John a lut kuonun tua pa in mu a, ama gel kungah sum a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />John ma bangin Peter in zong tua pa encien a, “Ko gel ei en vawi” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua pa in zong bang khat nga ding ci kinepna tawh ama gel a lim-et mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter in, “Ngun le kham ka nei poma sih hi, hizongle ka nei pen kang pie hi; Nazareth mi Jesu Khris’ min tawh ding inlen lam pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in tua pa a zietlam khut tawh manin a kaito leh thakhatin a keng le a sietmitte a khaupai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama kitomin dingto a, lam pei pai-in amate tawh biehinnpi sungah lut a, a lam pei kawmin dieng vazawhin Pasien min’ a phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi zosie in ama lam pei-in Pasien a phat a mu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuale ama pen biehinnpi’ Kotpi Hoi gei-ah to-in sum ngenngen pa ahi lam amate in a thei uhi; tuale ama tunga a pieng thute ziehin amate in lamdang sa-in a lungmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua mipa in Peter le John a tuhdet laitahin mi zosie in lamdang a sa vua, amau’ opna Solomon Talap a kici innhlim lamah tai-in a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Peter in a mu ciengin mipite kungah, “No Israel-te aw, tam mipa lam ka peisah theina uh pen ka vang ule ka hoina uh zieh sa-in bang dingin ei cien-et na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I pupite ahi Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob-te’ Pasien in a nasempa Jesu a minthangsah zo hi. Tua pa pen Pilat in hla dingin a khensat vangin note in ama na niel vua, Pilat mai-ah tha dingin na pie ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Note in a Siengtho le Midih Pa na niel vua, mithat pa khat a hla nadingin na ngen zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Note in Hinna a piengsah pa na that vua, hizongle Pasien in misite lah panin ama a thosah hi. Tam thu-ah kote teci ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama’ min upna hang tawh tua ama’ min mama in na mu ule na thei uh ahi tua pa a thakhausah zo hi. Jesu tung pana kinga upna in note zosie mai-ah dam siengthona ama a pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tu-in lawmte aw, na makaite un a na bawl bangin note in zong na thei lo ziehun na bawlkhah lam uh ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ Messiah in gimna thuoh ding hi, ci-in kamsangte zosie tung panin a na magensa thute Pasien in tam bangin a tangtungsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin na mawnate uh a kiphietmai thei nadingin kisiakia-in Pasien lamah kihei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa kung panin tha tha ngana hun ang tung ding a, ama in note dinga a kisekholsa Messiah ahi Jesu ang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien in a kamsang mi siengthote tungtawnin a tangko bangin na zosie a kibawlthakia hun masangsie vantungah Jesu a op kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Moses in, ‘ Topa na Pasien un na mite panin note adingin keima tawh kibang kamsang khat ang piengsah ding hi. Ama in na kung vua ang gen popo note in na man ding uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua kamsangpa’ thugen a mang lo poma a mite lah panin kiphungkal ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel a kipanin a nua-a ang pieng kamsang zosie in zong tuhun thupiengte a na genkhol tabo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Note pen kamsangte le Pasien in na pu na pate uh tunga a na pieh thuciemna’ suonlehlahte na hi vua, tuaci’n ama in Abraham kungah, ‘Na suon na hlahte sungah leitung innkuon zosie thupha kipie ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pasien in a sila pa a thawsah ciengin na gitlona zosie panun kihei-in thupha ang pieh thei nadingin na kung vuah ama ang sawl masah ahi hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipite tungah Peter le John in thu a gen laitahun ama gel kungah siempute, biehinn uhpa, le Sadducees-te a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama gel in Jesu sungah misite thawkiana om hi, ci-in a gen zieh gelin nawngkai a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Peter le John a man vua, nitah lam hi ta ahi ziehin a zing cieng dong thong sungah a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin thungaite lahah mi tampi in a um vua, thu um mi tul nga bang a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zing ciengin Jerusalem ah a gam-uhte uh, upate, le thukham hil siete a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua sungah siempu lien Annas, Caiaphas, John, Alexander, le siempu liente’ innkuonpi zosie zong a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A laikim vuah thongkie tegel dingsahin, “No gel in bang thuneina le bang min tawh tami na bawl uh ahei,’ ci-in a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hlagau Siengtho tawh Peter kidimin amate kungah, “Gam uhte le upate aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuni-in cina pa khat tunga sil hoi ka bawl ziehun tam pa bangci banga a natna dam thei ahei, ci-in ei dong na hi uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />note zosie le Israel-te zosie in kithei ta un. A dam sienga na mai vua ang ding tam mipa pen singlamte tunga na khailia uh, Pasien in misite lah pan a thawsahkia pa Nazareth mi Jesu Khris’ min zieha dam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tami Jesu pen, ‘No innlamte in na nildawh uh suong, innkiu suong bulpi a suoh hi,’ kici pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang koima khat beh sungah hutdamna a om sih hi, azieh pen vansin nei-a a om mihingte lahah i kihutdamna nadinga kipie min dang khat zong a om sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in amate in Peter le John pen sinna nei vawt lo mi maimai hi lel napi uh, amau’ hangsanna a mu ciengun lamdang a sa mama vua, Jesu tawh kithuo ngaite ahi lam uh zong a phawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama tegel’ gei-ah damna nga pa dingin a om a mu ciengun amate in langpan nading thu bangma a gen thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n khatlekhat tam thu a kikup sungun biehna uliente kung panin a peikhiet nadingun thu a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in, “Tam mite bang law ding i hei? Bangzieh ahei cile amate tungtawnin a kilang mama lim khat a pieng zo hi, ci thu Jerusalem khuo-a tengte zosie in cientahin a thei ta vua, eite in zong tua thu i niel thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin mite lahah tam thute a kizelthang nawn lo nadingin, tulang kalsie koima kungah tami min tawh thu a gen nawn lo nadingun amate thu pie vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama gel hlanin Jesu’ min tawh thu genin thu a hil nawn lo nadingun thu a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter le John in, “Note’ thu manzawh ding le Pasien’ thu manzawh ding, Pasien muna-ah koi manzaw ding ahei, ci noma ma in khensat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kote in ka musa ule ka zahsa uh thute gen loin ka om thei sih uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in mipite ziehin ama gel dan pieh nading lampi a mu lo ziehun a galgih zaw ciengin a hlakia uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile a pieng thute ziehin amate in a unpi-un Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen tami damna lim lamdang a kibawlna mipa pen a khan kum sawm li val pha zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama gel a kihla zaw ciengin a guolte kungah pei-in siempu uhpite le upate in ama gel kunga a gen uh thu zosie a zasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in tua thu a zah ciengun a aw uh sangsahin Pasien kungah thu a ngenton vua, “Vanpi le leipi, tuipi, le tua teng sunga a om sil bangkim a siem Thunei pen Topa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />nang in na nasempa ka pu uh David tung panin Hlagau Siengtho tawh thu na gen a: ‘Bang dingin Gentile-te lungthahin, bang dingin mite in thu mawhnate ngaisun uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa le ama’ Messiah do dingin leitung kumpite in panmun la-in, gam uhte kikhawm zo uhi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen Herod le Pontius Pilat in Gentile-te le Israel-te tawh na sathau nusa pa, a siengtho na nasem Jesu langpang dingin tam khuopi sungah amate a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma in na gelna bangin a pieng dinga na khut tawh na sekholsa popo amate in a sem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa aw, tu-in amau’ ei galgihna ei theipi inlen, ko na nasemte hangsan tahin thu ei gensah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cinate dam nadingin na khut zah inlen, a siengtho na nasempa Jesu’ minin lim le na lamdangte kibawl heh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in thu a nget zaw ciengun a kikhopna mun uh a kiling hi; amate zong a unpi-un Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidimin Pasien’ thu hangsan tahin a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu-in thu um mite a lungsim le a ngaisutna uh a kikhat vua, tuaci’n koima in a a neisa khat popo kei-a’ tuom ci loin neisa zosie a neiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sawltahpite in vanglietna lienpi tawh Topa Jesu’ thawkiana thu teci a pang vua, amate zosie tungah Pasien’ hepina lienpi a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A neisa uh inn le lote zua-in a nga uh sumte a tawi ciet ziehun amate lahah a tasam koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in sawltahpite keng zungah tua sumte koi-in a kisapna dung zui-in mi zosie a hawmpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cyprus khuo-a pieng, Joseph kici Levi-te khat, sawltahpite in Barnabas (Hanthawn Siempa’ Tapa a cinopna) a ci uh mipa khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama in a neisa logam khat zua-in a sum teng peipi-in sawltahpite’ keng phungah a koi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ananias kici pasal khat in a zi Sapphira’ thukimna tawh a neisa uh khat a zua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a zi’ thei-in sum kimkhat hendap a, halkhat beh peipi-in nuazuite’ keng phungah a lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Peter in, “Ananias aw, Hlagau Siengtho sol ding le na logam zua man sum pawlkhat a hendap dingin Satan in bang dingin na lungsim kizosah na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na zua masangin nangma-a’ hi a, na zua zaw ciengin zong nangma-a’ ma hi lo amah? Bang dinga tua banga gamtat ding hanciem na hei? Kote ei sol na hi sih a, Pasien sol na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ananias in tam thu teng a zah behin puasuhin a si hi. Tam thu a za zosie zong a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tangvalte pei-in puon tawh a luong a tun vua, tua ciengin ama puo-in a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua zaw nai thum bang ciengin a zi zong thupieng teng thei loin a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Peter in tua nu kungah, “Nang le na pasal in na logam uh tamza ma na khawh uh amah, ei gen in,” ci-in dong hi. Tua nu in, “Hi hi, tua za ma hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in ama kungah, “ Topa’ Hlagau ze-et dingin bang dinga hici kithukim gel na hi uh ahei? En in, na pasal vuite kot lamah om hi, nang zong ang puokhie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in a keng phungah tua nu puasuhin a si pai hi. Tangvalte a lut ciengun a sisa-in ama a mu vua, tuaci’n amate in puodawhin a pasal gei-ah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hlattuom pawlpi buppi le tami thu a za zosie a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in sawltahpite tungtawnin mite lahah lim le na lamdang tampi a pieng hi. Tuale Solomon’ Talap ah amate a omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koima dang in amate a kipawlpi ngam sih vua, ahi vangin mite in amate a pimu mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu um mi numei le pasalte a tam semsem vua, nidang sangin Topa sungah mi a kibelaplap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Peter in tua mun nawhin a pei ciengin amate kimkhat tungah a hlim a tuh khah nadingin, lampi-ah cinate puo-in lupna tung le pheh tungah a siel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem kima a om khuote panin zong mi tampi kisutuo-in cinate le hlabua in a bawlsiet mite a peipi vua, a unpi-un damna a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in na sep a sawm ta hi; ama le a kipawlpi zosie in (Sadducees pawlte a ci na) hazatna tawh a kidim ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sawltahpite manin taangpi thong sungah a khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin zan lai-in Topa’ vantungmi khat in thong kotte hongin amate a hladawh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Pei-in biehinnpi sungah ding unlen, mite tungah hinna thu bucing va hil ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam thu a zah ciengun khuova behin biehinnpi sungah lutin a thuhilna maban a zom uhi. Siempu lien pa le a pawlte a tun uh ciengin, amate in biehna uliente le Israel upa buppi kikhawmsahin amate hlakhie dingin thong sungah a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin khumnah biehinncing palihte a tun ciengun thong sungah amate a mu sih uhi. Tua ahi ciengin a kilekia vua, amate in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thonginn kot hoitahin kikilin kot mai-a ding thongcingte ka mu vua, ahi vangin kot ka hon ciengun a sungah koima ka mu sih uhi,” ci-in thu a zasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Biehinnpi uhpa le siempu liente in tam thu bang ang suoh diei izaw! ci-in a lungmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi khat ang tung a, “En un, thong sunga na khum uh mite in biehinnpi sungah dingin mite thu a hil uhi!” ci-in a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin biehinnpi uhpa le palihte in amate bangma bawlsie loin a zawpi uhi, azieh pen mite in amate suong tawh a se khah ding a zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate a tunpi zaw ciengun biehna uliente mai-ah a dingsah uhi. Siempu lien pa in amate thu dong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tam pa’ min tawh thu na hil nawn lo nadingun khautahin thu kang pieh hi napi na thuhilna un Jerusalem khuo sung teng na dim zo ta vua, ko tungah tam pa’ sisan ang tun nadingin zong na hanciem uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter le nuazuite in, “Mihing’ thu sangin Pasien’ thu ka man uh kulzaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I pu i pate’ Pasien in singkhuom tunga na khailia pa uh Jesu a thokiasah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasien in Israel-te tungah kisiana le mawmaina a pieh nadingin a zietlamah Lamkai pa ding le Hundam pa dingin ama a tawisang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam thu-ah kote teci ka hi vua, Pasien in a thu a mang mite tungah a pieh Hlagau Siengtho zong teci ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in tam thu a zah ciengun a lungthah mama vua, sawltahpite tha a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin biehna uliente sung panin mi zosie in a zatah Gamaliel a kici thukham hil sie Pharisees-te khat ding to-in bakhat sung tua mite a pusuo nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tua mite kungah, “Israel-te aw, note in tam mite tunga na bawl dingte uh pilvangin kidawm un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile masang lai khatin kei zong mi khat ma ka hi hi, a kici Theudas ang khang a, mi zali bang in ama a pawlpi uhi; ahi vangin tua pa kithat a, tuale ama a zui zosie kithezahin a mangthai sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama’ nua, mi phaza a kisim hun sungin Galilee mi Judah ang khang leuleu a, ama in zong nuazui ding mi a nei hi; ama a si ciengin a nuazui zosie zong a kithezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuaci’n tulaitah i thu tawh kisai-a kang gen nuom ah, amate pel-in hici opsah phot lel un; azieh pen tami gelna le sepna pen mihing pana ang kipan ahile ang kisie lel ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />ahi vangin Pasien tung pana ang kipan ahile lah na zo sih ding vua, tami thu-ah Pasien tawh kido-in ang kimu zaw ding uhi!” a ci hi. Amate in tua pa thugen a sang thei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />inn sungah sawltahpite hlanin a satziel uhi. Tua ciengin Jesu’ min tawh thu a gen nawn lo nadingun amate thu a pieh zaw ciengun a hlakia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Biehna uliente kung pan a peikhiet ciengun amate in ama’ min ziehin mindaina thuoh tah sa-in a lungdam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nisimin biehinnpi sung le inn sungah Jesu, Messiah ahi hi, ci-in khawl loin thu hilin a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hunin nuazuite khang tehtehin Greek ham a zang Jew mite in nisim anneh hawmna-ah a meigongte uh kithudon lo hi, ci-in Hebrew mite a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sawm le nite in zong nuazui mi buppi hlanin amate kungah, Pasien thu gen ding don man lo lienga anneh tuidawn vai tawh kang kitala ding uh ko adingin kilawm lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin lawmte aw, no sung panin mite in a zatah, Hlagau le pilna tawh a kidim pasal sagi teel unlen tami nasep a sem dingin ka koi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ko ka hi ule thungetna le thuhilna lamah kang kipumpieh ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amau’ thugen in mi honpite lungkimsah ahi ziehin, amate in upna le Hlagau Siengtho tawh a kidim Stephen, Philip, Prochorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas, le Judah biehna panin a kikhel Antioch khuomi Nicolas-te a teel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in sawltahpite mai-ah tua mite dingsahin a lu tung vuah khut nga-in thu a ngetpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien’ thu kizel suohin Jerusalem ah nuazuite nahpi tahin khang a, siempu tampite in zong tua upna thu a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Stephen, hepina le vanglietna tawh kidim a, ama in mite lahah lim le na lamdang thupite a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Suohta Mite’ kikhopna (amau’ kilawna) panin mi pawlkhat, Cyrene-te, Alexander-te, Cilicia gam le Asia gam panin mite in Stephen langpangin a kisel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle ama in pilna le Hlagau tawh a gen thute amate in a nang zo tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Ama in Moses le Pasien simmawna thu a gen ka za uhi,” ci-a a gen dingin mi pawlkhat a hantawh vua, a cieldap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in mipite, upate le thukham hil siete zong a tawhnawi uhi; tua ciengin Stephen tawh kitalsihin ama manin biehna uliente kungah a puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zuouthu teci dingin zong mi a ciel vua, “Tam mipa in tami siengtho mun le thukham a gensie zing mielmuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tami Nazareth mi Jesu in tam mun susie gawpin Moses ei pieh ngainate zong ka khelmang ding hi, ci-in a gen ka za uhi,” a cisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biehna uliente kikhopna sunga to mi zosie in Stephen a etcien ule amate in a maitang, vantungmi’ maitang tawh kibangin a mu ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa in ama kungah, “Tam thu a man ma amah?” ci-in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Stephen in: “Sanggamte le pate aw, na ngai un. Haran khuo ah i pu uh Abraham a ten masang, Mesopotamia gama a op lai-in ama kungah vanglien Pasien na kilah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Na gam na lei le na be na phungte nuasie inlen, nangma kang lah ding gamah pei in,’ na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in Chaldea-te gam nuasie-in Haran khuo ah a teng hi. A pa a si zaw ciengin Pasien in tua panin tu-a na tenna uh gamah na lalsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in tua gamah a luo ding leitang kephangcie khat nangawn a na pie sih a, ta a nei sih vangin ama’ nua-a pieng a suon a hlahte tungah tua gam pieh dingin a na kamciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin midang gam khatah a suon a hlahte pemta-in omin salin kiman ding a, amate in kum zali sung bawlsietna a thuoh ding uhi, ci-in Pasien in tam bangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Ahi vangin keima in amau’ na a semsah tua minam tungah thu ka khen ding hi,’ Pasien in ci a, ‘Tua zaw ciengin amate pusuohin tam munah keima ei bie ding uhi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in ama teptan thuciemna a pie hi. Tuaci’n Abraham pen Isaac’ pa hi a, a suo zaw ni giet ni-in a tep a tanpieh hi. Isaac pen Jacob’ pa hi a, Jacob pen sawm le nite’ pienna pupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pupite in Joseph a na haza vua, Egypt gamah a na zua uhi; hizongle Pasien in ama a oppi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />gentheina panin ama na hunkhie-in Egypt kumpi pa Pharaoh mai-ah a din ciengin pilna le maipha na ngasah ahi ziehin Egypt gam le ama’ inn sung vai zosie a uhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt gam le Canaan gam sung teng zosie-ah kielpi le hahsatna lienpi tung a, i pu i pate in an neh ding a na mu zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jacob in Egypt gamah an om hi, ci a zah bepin tua munah a khatveina a haw dingin i pate a na sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A niveina a haw ciengun Joseph in a sanggamte kungah ama koi ahei, ci ama le ama na kigen a, tuaci’n Pharoah in Joseph’ innkuonpi teng na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in mi sawlin ama kunga pei dingin a pa Jacob le a hieng a san teng zosie hlansah a, amate a unpi-un sawm sagi le nga a pha uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaci’n Egypt gamah Jacob peisuh a, i pu i pate ma bangin tua gamah ama zong a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shechem-ah a luong uh kipuokia a, Abraham in Shechem khuomi Hamor’ tapate tung panin dangka tawh a na leisa hankhuh sungah ama kivui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien in Abraham tunga a bawl a thuciemna a tun kuonin Egypt gamah ei mite pungin a tam tehteh vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Egypt gamah Joseph thei lo kumpi dang khat a khan cieng dongin amate a pung a meng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in i minamte a ngien tawh bawl a, a tasente uh a si nadingin a paimang nadingun i pu i pate zawthaw bawlin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua hun sungin Moses suoh a, ama pen Pasien mai-ah a meel hoi mama hi. A pa inn ah ama hla thum sung kikem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama a kipaimang ciengin Pharaoh’ tanu in a tapa dingin la a, ama in a tapa bang lienin bawlin a khansuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Egypt pilna zosie Moses kihil a, thugenna le na sepna-ah mi thupi mama khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kum sawmli a phah ciengin a sanggam Israel-te kunga haw ding a lungsim ah a kilo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Egypt mi khat in a mipite khat a bawlsiet a mu ciengin phu la a, ama in a bawlsiet pa humin Egypt pa a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasien in ama tungtawnin amate a hunkhie ding ahi lamtah a tanaute in a thei ding sa a, ahi vangin amate in a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A zing ciengin amate lahah a kihau mi pawlkhat kungah pei-in lemtuo ding hanciem a, ‘Guoite aw, sanggam na hi bo uhi; bang dinga kihau na hi uh ahei?’ a va ci ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin a vengpa a bawlsie pa in Moses thalsawn a, ‘Ko ei uh ding le thu ei khen dinga koi in nang ang se ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zani-a Egypt mipa na tha banga kei zong ei tha sawm na hi amah?’ na ci giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam thu a zah ciengin Moses taimangin Midian gamah pemta-in a va om ta a, khum gamah tapa ni a va nei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Kum sawmli a cin zaw ciengin Sinai Muol gamlah sawlbawh kawm meikuong sung panin vantungmi khat ama kungah a va kilah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Moses in tua a sil mu pen lamdang a sa mama hi; a en dingin ama in a va nai ta leh tua panin Topa’ aw ging a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />‘Kei pen na pu na pate uh’ Pasien, Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob-te’ Pasien ka hi hi,’ a ci hi. Moses citun gawpin a en ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, ‘Na dinna mun leitang a siengtho ahi ziehin na kedap suo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Keima in Egypt gama ka mite kibawlsietna ka mu tahtah ta a, a tauna uh zong ka za zo ta a, amate hunkhie dingin keima kang kumsuh zo hi. Tu-in hing pei in, Egypt gamah nang kang sawl ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Moses pen amate in, ‘Koi in ei uh ding le thukhen dinga nang ang se ahei? ci-a a niel pa uh ahi a, tu-in ahile Pasien in sawlbawh kawm ama tunga a kilah vantungmi tungtawnin a uh ding le a hunkhie dinga a sawl pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in Egypt gam, San tuipi le senel gam sungah kum sawmli sung lim le na lamdangte a bawl zaw ciengin amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />‘Pasien in note adingin na mipite sung panin kei tawh a kibang kamsang khat ang piengsah ding hi,’ ci-a Israel-te kunga a gen pa khu tami Moses ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama pen senel gam mihon kikhopna lah, Sinai Muol tunga ama a hopi vantungmi, le i pu i pate tawh a omton pa ahi hi. Eite tunga ei pieh ding thuphuonte a sangsawn pa zong a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />I pu i pate in ama’ thu a mang nuom sih uhi; tuale mahin ama na puse-in Egypt gamah kilekia nopna lungsim a nei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Aaron kungah, ‘Ka lampi vuah kote ei pui dingin pasien-te ei bawlpieh in; azieh pen Egypt panin ei peipi tami Moses lah bang tuoh a ta ahei, ka thei zo ta sih uhi,’ a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tua hunin amate in bawngno lim khat bawl pai-in tua milim adingin kithoina silpieh a pie vua, amate in a khut vua a bawl uh a nasepte uh tungah a kipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in amate elngat a, a kamsangte laibu sungah a kigiel ma bangin vantung nate a bie dingin amate a pie ta hi: ‘Israel innkuonte aw, gamlahah kum sawmli sung, gante go-in na biehpiehnate uh kei tunga nei pieh uh ahi ngel ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ahi sih hi; note in Moloch pasien’ puonbuh tawh, na pasien uh ahi Rephan aasi le na bieh ding vua na bawl uh milimte na puoton uhi. Tuaci’n Babylon galah note kang hemkhie ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />I pu i pate in gamlahah teci panna puonbuh a nei vua, tua khu Pasien in Moses kunga a na hilsa, a musa a lim banga kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Pasien in i pu i pate mai-a a na naw dawh minamte’ leitang a suonmang ciengun, i pu i pate in Joshua tawh tua puonbuh na puo leuleu vua, tua munah David hun cieng dong a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />David in Pasien’ maipha nga a, Jacob’ biehinn opna mun khat a mu thei nadingin Pasien kungah thu ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama adinga biehinn a lampieh pa pen Solomon ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ahi vangin mihingte’ khut tawh a kibawl inn sungah Sangpen Pasien a teng sih hi. Kamsang pa in a gen bangin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />‘Vantung ka tona ahi a, leitung, ka keng ngahna ahi hi. Kei adingin bang inn lam ding na hi uh ahei? Ahi sihle ka khawl nading bang mun ahei? Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tamte zosie keima’ khutsuo vive hi lo amah?’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />“No a lungkhau, na lungsim ule na bil vua tep kitan lo mite aw, na pu na pate uh’ gamtat bang lienin na gamta vua, Hlagau Siengtho na langpang ngitnget uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Na pu na pate un a bawlsiet lo kamsang koi om ahei? Amate in Midih Pa pei nadinga thu magente a that vua, tu-in note pen tua pa a lehehte le a thatte na suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Note in vantung mite tung pana ang kipie thukham na nga vangun na zui tuom sih uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tam thute a zah ciengun amate lungso-in Stephen a ha a gawisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ahi vangin Stephen pen Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidim a, ama in vantung a ento leh Pasien’ vanglietna le Pasien’ zietlama a ding Jesu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ama in, “En un,” vantungte kihongin Pasien’ zietlamah mihing Tapa a ding ka mu hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hizongle amate in a bil uh humin awging tah tawh kiko-in ama lamah a honpi-un a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuo pulamah ama kaiphit gawpin suong tawh a sep uhi. Tecite in a puontungsilte uh Saul a kici tangval pa khat’ keng phungah a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Amate in suong tawh Stephen a se laitahun ama in thungen a, “ Topa Jesu aw, ka hla la ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tua ciengin khupdinin nahpi tahin kiko a, “ Topa aw , amate na mawsah sin,” a ci zaw ciengin a si hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ni-in Jerusalem ah hlattuom pawlpi bawlsietna lienpi kipan a, sawltahpite simlo mi zosie, Judea gam le Samaria gam mun zosie-ah a kithethang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien’ thu-a kipumpieh mite in Stephen a vui vua, ama ziehin nahpi tahin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanle inn khat zaw inn khatah Saul lutin hlattuom pawlpi susie a, numei le pasalte kaiphitin thong sungah a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu-in a kithethang mite mun khat pan mun khatah a vah kawikawi vua, Pasien’ thu a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Samaria khuopi khatah Philip peisuh a, amate kungah Messiah thu a tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihonpi in Philip’ thugente za-in, a na lamdang bawlte a mu ciengun lungsim kikhatin a thu gente lawptahin a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen dawivei mi tampite sung panin hlabua nei mite a awng vagua uhi; tuale amate zong pusuohin phalsi le khelbai mi tampi in damna a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n tua khuopi sungah kipahna lienpi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuami khuo sungah Simon kici mi khat om a, ama in ni dangin mitphiel lahin, Samaria mite a na cizasah mama a, kei zong mi thupi khat ka hi hi, na kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a neupen panin a golpen dongin a unpi-un a thugen lawptahin a ngai vua, “Tam pa khu Vanglienpa a kici Pasien’ vanglietna ahi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in a mitphiel tawh hun sauveipi sung amate lamdang sasah ahi ziehin amate in a thugen lawptahin a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Pasien’ manggam lungdamna thu le Jesu Khris’ min a tangko Philip a up uh ciengin a numei pasalin a ki-baptize uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Simon mama nangawn in zong a um hi. A ki-baptize zaw ciengin Philip kungah ama om den a, a pieng limte le na lamdang lienpite a mu ciengin lamdang a sa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria-te in Pasien’ thu sang thei ta uhi, ci thu Jerusalem-a om sawltahpite in a zah ciengun amate kungah Peter le John a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama gel peisuhin Samaria-te in Hlagau Siengtho a nga nadingun thu a ngetpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />(azieh pen amate khat beh tungah Hlagau tung nai lo hi. Amate ahile Topa Jesu’ min beh tawh a ki-baptize zo pan ahi na bo uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter le John in amate tungah khut a nga vua, tuale amate in Hlagau Siengtho a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sawltahpite’ khut ngahna tawh Hlagau a kipieh lam Simon in a mu ciengin ama gel tungah sum lui-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mi khatpo tunga khut ka ngah ciengin Hlagau Siengtho a nga thei nadingin tami vanglietna kei zong ei pie gel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter in ama kungah, “Sum tawh Pasien’ letsong nga sawm na hi ziehin na sum tawh mangthaiton in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien mai-ah na lungtang dih lo ahi ziehin tami thu-ah na kihal thei sih a, tanh zong na nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tami na gitlona panin kisiakia inlen Topa kungah thu ngen in. Ama in na lungsim sunga na ngaisutna ang maisah thei kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sinkha bangin na lungsim zong kha a, gitlona in nang ang kanbawm lam ka mu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simon in, “Na thugen khat beh ka tunga ang tun lo nadingin Topa kungah thu ei ngetpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu-in Peter le John in teci pangin Topa’ thu a gen zaw cieng gelin Jerusalem khuopi ah kilekia-in Samaria khuo tampite-ah lungdamna thu a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ vantungmi khat in Philip kungah, “Tho inlen Jerusalem pan Gaza lam zotna leitaw lamah va pei ta’n,” a ci hi. (Tua khu senel gam lampi ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama zong tho-in a pei pai hi. Khumin Ethiopia kumpinu Candace’ khut nei-a vaihawm mangpa le kumpinu’ gou zosie a uh cilgesa Ethiopia mangpa khat a om hi. Pasien bie dingin Jerusalem khuo ah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kilekia ciengin a sakol leeng tung tuong kawmin kamsang Isaiah’ laibu a sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Hlagau in Philip kungah, “Pei inlen tami sakol leeng zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Philip zong tua pa kungah tai phei a, kamsang Isaiah laibu a sim a za hi. Ama in, “Tua na laisim a thu na telsiem ei mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Ei hil a op sih leh bang ka ci thei ding ahei?” ci-in a dawng hi. Leeng tungah tua pa tuongin ama gei-a to dingin Philip a ciel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua a lai siengtho mun sim khu tami ahi hi: “Tha dinga kipeipi tuu bangin ama kipeipi hi. A mul metpa mai-ah a ham lo tuuno bangin ama in a kam a kah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama a kiniemkhieh ziehin ama tungah thutang kizang lo hi. Ama’ khanggui koi in sut thei ding ahei? Azieh pen leitung panin ama’ hinna kila zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cilgesa Ethiopia mangpa in Philip kungah, “Thu khat hing dong vang, tami kamsangpa ama le ama kigen amah, ahi sihle midang khat’ thu gen hizaw ahei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ciengin Philip thugen kipan a, tua a lai siengtho simna mun panin ama kungah Jesu’ thu ahi lungdamna thu a tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lampi-ah amate a pei laitahun tui opna mun khatah a tung uhi. Cilgesa mangpa in, “En un, tanah tui a om hi! Ka ki-baptize ding bang in ei kham ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuale Philip in, “Na lungsim zosie tawh na up leh na ki-baptize thei hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Jesu Khris pen Pasien’ Tapa ahi hi, ci-in ka um hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in a leeng khawlsah a, tui sungah Philip le cilgesa mangpa a nipi-in a kumsuh vua, Philip in ama a baptize hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tui sung panin ama gel a kato ciengun Topa’ Hlagau in Philip a lato hi; tua cilgesa mangpa in ama a mu nawn sih a, tuale ama’ lampi-ah lungdam tahin a pei ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in Azotus khuo-ah Philip mukia a, ama in tua gam teng nawh a, Caesarea a tun dongin khuo zosie-ah lungdamna thu a tangko hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul in tua hun sung tengin Topa’ nuazuite tha dingin galgihin husang na lai a, siempu lien pa kungah pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua Lampi a zui numei pasal a mu popo uh hensa-in Jerusalem a tut thei nadingun ama in Damascus khuo-a biehinn uhte kungah phalna lai ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama pei-in Damascus khuo a tun kuon ciengin vantung panin khuovah khat in a kimkot thakhatin a khawsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilahah ama puasuh a, “Saul, Saul aw, bangzieh a kei nei ci bawlsiet ahei?” ci-in awging khat a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa aw, nang koi na hei?” ci-in dong hi. Ama in, “Nei bawlsiet Jesu ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hizongle tho inlen khuopi sungah lut lacin na bawl ding thu ang kigen ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khuolzinpi mite in tua awging a zah vangun koima in mu lo ahi ziehin gen ding thei loin a dinggaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilah panin Saul thoto a, a mit a ha vangin khuo a mu thei sih hi; tuaci’n amate in a khut tawh ama tu-in Damascus khuo sungah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ni thum sung khuo mu thei loin, an ne lo tui dawn loin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khumin Damascus ah Ananias kici nuazui khat a om hi. Topa in a mangmuna sungah, “Ananias,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Tanah om ing, Topa aw, ” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Tho inlen Lampi Zang a kici khatah pei-in, tuale Judas’ inn ah Tarsus khuomi Saul a kici pa va sui ta’n. Tu laitahin ama thungenin a om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in khuo a mukia thei nadingin Annaias a kici mi khat pei-in ama’ lu tungah a khut a ngahna thu, a mangmuna sungah a mu hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Ananias in, “ Topa aw, tam pa in Jerusalem-a na misiengthote tungah bangza tahin sietna bawl ahei ci thu mi tampite tung panin ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam sunga om na min a lo mi zosie a hen thei nadingin ama in siempupite tung panin thu a nga zo hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle Topa in ama kungah, “Va pei in, bangzieh ahei cile ama pen Gentile-te, kumpite, le Israel-te mai-ah ka min a puo dinga ka tuomtelsa ka vanzah khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in keima’ min ziehin bangza-in gimna thuoh ding ahei, ci pen kei mama in ama ka lah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Ananias pei-in tua inn sungah a lut hi. Ama in Saul tungah a khut nga a, “Sanggam pa Saul aw, nangma in khuo mu theikia-in Hlagau Siengtho tawh na kidim thei nadingin tami mun na peina lampi-a ang kilah ahi Topa Jesu in kei ei sawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuale thakhatin Saul’ mit panin ngalip tawh a kibang na khat kiesuh a, ama zong tho-in ki-baptize pai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an halkhat a neh zaw ciengin a tha a hatkia hi. Damascus khuo-a om nuazuite tawh ama ni tampi a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kikhopna inn sungah, “Ama Pasien’ Tapa ahi hi,” ci-in thakhatin Jesu’ thu tangko ding a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thugen a za zosie in lamdang sa-in, “ Tam mipa, Jerusalem-a Jesu’ min a lote a bawlsie pa hi lo amah? Siempupite mai-ah amate hensa-a puoh ding a ngimna tawh ama tana ang pei hi lo amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul vang nei semsem a, Jesu in Messiah ahi hi, ci-in a hilcien ziehin ama in Damascus-a teng Jew mite a amtumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni tampi zaw ciengin Jew mite in ama a daptha sawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hinanle amate in a tha sawm lamtah Saul in a thei hi. Ama a tha thei nadingun sun le zanin tunkot tengah a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin zan lai-in a nuazuite in Saul peipi-in kulvang panin bawng tawh a khiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ama a tun ciengin nuazuite tawh kipawl ding a hanciem hi; tuale amate in nuazui dingin ama um zo lo uh ahi ziehin amate zosie in ama a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hizongle Barnabas in Saul hlanin sawltahpite kungah peipi a, a lam pei laitaha ama a hopi Topa a mu dan, Damascus khuo-a Jesu min’ tawh hangtaha a thugen dan zosie teng amate a hilcien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem khuo sunga om amate lahah ama sungtum pusuohin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama pen Greek ham a zang Jew mite tawh zong thu a kisel hi; hinanle amate in ama tha a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thu um mite in tua thu a thei ciengun Caesarea khuo ah ama peipi suhin Tarsus khuo ah a hla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua hun sung tengin Judea gam, Galilee gam le Samaria gam zosie-a om hlattuom pawlpite in lungmuonna le kilamna a nga uhi. Topa zatahna sung le Hlagau Siengtho henepna sungah a nuntah ziehun amate a pung semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu-in thu um mite lahah Peter zin kawikawi a, Lydda khuo-a om mi siengthote kungah zong a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua munah ama in a phalsi, kum giet sung lupmun tung ngah Aeneas kici mi khat a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Peter in tua pa kungah, “Aeneas aw, Jesu Khris in ang damsah zo ta hi; tho inlen na lupna ziel in!” a ci hi. Tuale thakhatin ama a tho pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lydda le Sharon khuo-a teng mi zosie in tua pa a mu uh ciengin Topa lamah a kihei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khumin Joppa khuo ah Tabitha a kici nuazui numei khat om a, a min pen Greek kamin Dorcas ahi hi. Ama pen sil hoite sem ding le mi khuotuona lam sem dinga kipumpieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua laitahin tua nu a ci na-in a si hi. Tua nu’ luong a buol zaw ciengun inndan tungnungah ama a siel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Lydda khuo pen Joppa khuo tawh kinai hi a, tua khuo ah Peter a op lam nuazuite in a zah ciengun mi ni sawlin, “Kiheh loin ko kungah hing hawpah ta’n,” ci-in a thumsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n Peter zong dingin amate tawh a zawhton pai hi; ama a tun ciengin amate in inndan tungnungah ama a zawpi uhi. Peter gei-ah meigong zosie a ding vua, a kaa kawmun Dorcas tawh a opton lai vua a gat songkholte le puontuolte ama a ensah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Peter in amate zosie pusuohsah a, tua ciengin ama khupdingin thu a ngen hi. Siluong lamah kihei-in, “Tibatha aw, tho in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin tua nu a mit hah a, Peter a mu ciengin tho-in a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in tua nu a khut hlahin a dingsah hi. Tua ciengin misiengthote le meigongte hlan a, tua a hing numei nu a ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Joppa khuo muncin tengah tam thu kizel a, mi tampi in Topa a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Khum hun sung tengin Simon a kici savun bawlpa khat tawh Joppa khuo ah bakhat sung ama a taam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khumin Ceasarea khuo-ah Italy Galkapte a kici lahah mi zakhat a uh Cornelius min nei galkapmang khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pen a innkuonpite tawh biehna lama kipumpieh Pasien a zatah mi khat ahi hi; ama in kiphaltahin mite tungah huna pie-in Pasien kungah thu ngen den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in nitah nai thum pawlin mang mu a, Pasien’ vantungmi khat pei-in ama kungah “Cornelius aw,” ci-in a hopina kicientahin a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a zau kawmin tua pa encien a, “Bang ahei Topa ?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Na thungetna le na kipiehnate, a kiphawh zing dingin Pasien mai-ah tungto zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Joppa khuo ah mi sawl inlen a min Peter kici Simon hlansah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama pen tuipi gei-a teng savun bawlpa Simon inn ah a tung hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama a hopi vantungmi a peikhiet zaw ciengin ama’ silate mi ni le ama’ na sem a galkapte lahah Pasien lamah a pawnthaw galkap khat hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ama in amate kungah thu zosie a gen zaw ciengin Joppa khuo ah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zing ni ciengin amate khuol a zin vua, khuopi a tun kuon uh sunkim pawl ciengin thungen dingin innkhumzang ah Peter kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Peter a gilkielin bangkhat a ne nuom hi; tuale an a kihuon laitahin Peter haitu pah a, mang khat a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van kihong a, tuale ama in a pheng golpi khat tawh a kibang na khat ang kumsuhin a ningli tawh leitunga ang kikhiehsuh a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua sungah kengli a nei ganhing namcin, a awm tawh a kithol ganhing namcin, le vana a leng va namcin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin, “Peter aw, tho inlen tuate go-in ne in,” a ci aw khat a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle Peter in, “ Topa aw, hi thei lo ding hi; azieh pen a bua le a sieng lo na khat popo ka ne ngai malmal sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua aw in ama a niveina hopi a, “Pasien in a sienga a bawlsate a bua ci paupau sin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thumvei dongin tua bangin pieng a, khum zaw ciengin vantung lamah tua sil a kilato kia ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua a mang muna pen bang a cinopna hi ding ahei, ci-in Peter a lungman mama laitahin Cornelius’ sawl mite in Simon’ inn a kan kawikawi vua, tunkot gei-ah thakhatin a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua munah Peter a kici Simon a tung ei mah, ci-in amate in a galdawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mang muna thu Peter in a ngaisut laitahin Hlagau in ama kungah, “En in, mihing thum in nang ang sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in tho-in kumsuh inlen uoikai loin amate tawh zawh in; azieh pen amate keima’ ang sawl ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua mite kungah Peter peisuh a, “Na sui pa uh keima ka hi hi; bang dinga tana hing pei na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in, “Nangma’ thugen ngai dingin Pasien a giing, Judah minam zosie in a zatah, mi zakhat a uh galkapmangpa Cornelius in ama’ inn ah nang ang hlan dingin vantungmi siengtho khat in thu pie zo hi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n Peter in inn sungah amate hlanin zin a tungsah hi. A zing ciengin tho-in amate tawh a peiton a, tuale Joppa panin zong thu um mite pawlkhat in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A zing ciengin Ceasarea khuo a tung uhi. Amate tun ding a lamet ziehin Cornelius in a hieng a san le a lawm a guolte na hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Peter a tun ciengin Cornelius in ama na dawn a, a keng phungah bawhin a bie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin Peter in ama phongto a, “Ding in; kei zong mihing ka hi lel bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama tawh a kiho kawmin inn sungah Peter a lut leh a kikhawm mi tampi a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Peter in amate kungah, “Judah mi khat adingin Gentile mi khat tawh kigop ding le kikawm ding pen thukham tawh kituoh lo hi, ci noma ma in na theisa uh ahi hi; ahi vangin mi khatpo a bua hi, ahi sihle a sieng lo ahi hi, ka ci lo nadingin Pasien in keima tungah ei lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n kei ei kihlat ciengin niel loin ka pei hi, tu-in note in bang dinga nei hlat uh ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cornelius in, “A tawpsa ni li lai tu bang hun nai thumin ka inn sungah thu ka nget laitahin puonpah a sil pasal khat thakhatin ka mai-ah ang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Cornelius aw, na thungetna kiza zo a, Pasien mai-ah na kipiehnate zong kiciemte zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Joppa ah mi sawl inlen, Peter a kici Simon va sui sah ta’n; tuipi gei-a teng savun bawlpa Simon inn ah ama a tung hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ke’n zong nang ang hlan dingin mi kang sawl pai a, nang pei thei ziehin hoi mama hi. Tuaci’n Topa in na gen dinga ang sawl thu zosie a ngai dingin tu-in Pasien mai-ah ka om uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate kungah Peter thu gen a kipan hi: “ Pasien in mi khentuom nei lo hi, ci thu ka thei tahtah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ama in minam zosie lahah ama giingin dihtaha a gamta mite a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in Israel mite tunga thu a na puoh, Jesu Khris zieha a kigen kilemna thu note in na thei uhi. Ama pen mi zosie’ Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />John in baptize-na thu a gen zaw ciengin Galilee gam panin Judea gam zosie-ah tua thu a kizel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pasien in Hlagau Siengtho le vanglietna tawh Nazareth mi Jesu sathau a nu hi; ama pei kawikawi-in na hoi a sem a, dawi mangpa’ bawlsiet mi zosie a damsah hi, azieh pen ama tawh Pasien a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Judah gam sung le Jerusalem khuo sunga ama’ bawl na zosie-ah kote teci ka hi uhi. Amate in sing tungah ama khai-in a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanle a ni thum ni-in Pasien in ama thosahkia-in mi tungah ama kilahsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />mi zosie tungah hi loin, misite panin ama a thawkia zaw ciengin Pasien in teci dinga ei teelsa, ama tawh an neton tuidawnton kote mai-ah ama ang kilah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama pen misite le a hinglai mite thu khen dingin Pasien in a sekhol pa ahi hi, ci thu mite tunga tangko ding le teci pang dingin Pasien in kote thu ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama a um tapo in ama’ min ziehin mawmaina a nga ding uhi, ci-in kamsang zosie in ama thu teci a pang zo uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Peter in tam thu a gen laitahin tua thu a za mi zosie tungah Hlagau Siengtho a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Peter tawh a zawhton a tep kitan thu um mite in Gentile-te tung nangawnah Hlagau Siengtho letsong a kibuoh ciengin lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Azieh pen tua mite kam tuomtuom tawh hamin Pasien’ min a phat uh amate in a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in, “Eima banga Hlagau Siengtho a nga tam mite a ki-baptize lo nadingin koi in tui kham thei ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Jesu Khris’ min tawh a ki-baptize nadingun amate thu a pie hi. Tua ciengin ni tampi sung a tam lai nadingin amate in ama a hlo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Gentile-te in zong Pasien’ thu sang zo ta uhi, ci thu Judea gama om sawltahpite le thu umte in a za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jerusalem ah Peter a peito ciengin a tep kitan thu um mite in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Bang ziehin a tep kitan lo mite kungah tungin amate tawh an neton mawh na hei? ci-in a mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter in a thu omzie teng a banbanin amate kungah sut a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Joppa khuo ah thu ngenin ka haituh laitahin mang ka mu hi. Keima in vantung panin a ningli ciet pana a kikhaisuh a peh golpi bang khat ka kunga ang tusuh ka mu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuami limtahin ka et leh keng li a nei ganhingte, sasielne gamsate, a bawhva ganhingte le vana a leng vate ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Awging khat in, “Peter aw, tho inlen, go-in ne in,” ei ci zong ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in, ‘ Topa , hi thei malmal sih; azieh pen a bua ahi sihle a sieng lo nate ka kam sungah a tum ngai nai vawt sih hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua awging ma in vantung panin a niveina ei dawng a, ‘Pasien in a sienga a bawlsate a bua hi bo ci paupau sin,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-a bangin thumvei ang pieng a, tua ciengin tua teng zosie a unpi-in vantungah a kikaito kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua laitahin ka opna inn ah Caesarea pana ang kisawl mi thumte thakhatin ang tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite le amau’ kikalah khentuom ci nei loin amate tawh a zawhton dingin kei kungah Hlagau in ei gen zo hi. Tami i sanggam guhte in zong ei zui vua, tua mipa’ inn ah ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in ka kung vuah a inn sunga vantungmi khat a din a mu dan le, ‘Joppa khuo-ah mi sawl inlen Peter a kici Simon hlansah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma le na innkuonpi bup un hutdamna na nga thei nading uh thu ang gen ding hi,’ a ci dan teng ei gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu gen ka kipat laitahin eite tungah Hlagau Siengtho a tuncil lai bangin amate tungah zong ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, ‘John in tui tawh na baptize a, ahi vangin note na hi ule Hlagau Siengtho tawh ang ki-baptize ding hi,’ ci-in a gen ka phawhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa Jesu Khris i up ciengin Pasien in letsong ei pieh bangin amate tungah zong a kibanga a pieh ahileh Pasien’ nasepna a khahtan zo dingin kei koi hi lel ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tami thu a zah ciengun amate a dai dide uhi. “Tua ciengin Pasien in Gentile-te tung nangawn ah zong hinna nga thei nading kisiakiana thu a pie hi,” ci-in amate in Pasien a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Stephen tungah bawlsietna a tun ziehin a kithethangte in Phoenicia gam, Cyprus tuikul, le Antioch dongin a banzin vua, amate in Jew mite kung simlo koima kungah thu a hil sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Antioch khuo-a pei, Cyprus tuikul le Cyrene khuo mite pawlkhat in Greek ham a zang Jew mite kungah zong Topa Jesu’ thu a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa’ khut amate tawh om a, Topa lamah thu um mi tampitah a kihei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem-a om hlattuom pawlpite in tami thu thate a zah ciengun Antioch khuo ah Barnabas a sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama tungin Pasien’ hepina thupha a mu ciengin a lungdam a, tuale ama in tupna kip tawh Topa tungah a citah nadingun amate a hanthawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama pen mi hoi, Hlagau Siengtho le upna tawh a kidim mi khat ahi ziehin Topa sungah mi tampi a kibelap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Tarsus khuo ah Saul sui dingin Barnabas pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuale ama a mu ciengin Antioch khuo ah a zawpi hi. Ama gel zong kum khat sung tungtawn hlattuom pawlpi mite tawh kimu-in mi tampi thu a hil uhi. “Tapidawte” ci-in a min kilo masa pente Antioch khuo-a nuazuite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hunin Jerusalem panin Antioch ah kamsangte a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate sung panin Agabus a kici mipa khat dingto-in, leitung gam zosie-ah a siehuoi kielpi khat tung ding hi, ci-in Hlagau tungtawnin a magen hi; tuale Claudias hun lai-in tuami thu tung ngai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nuazuite in ahi zaw za ciet utawh Judea gama teng thu um mite huna sum hlah dingin a khensat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amate in tua bangin a bawl vua, Barnabas le Saul tung panin upate kungah a hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun sawng tengin Herod Kumpipa in hlattuom pawlpi mi kimkhat a bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in John’ sanggampa James zong namsau tawh thatsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua thu in Jew mite lungkimsah hi, ci a mu bepin ama in Peter zong mansah leuleu hi. (tua hun pen Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi hun sung ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama a mat zaw ciengin ama in thong sungah khum a, Peisan Pawi a ven ciengin mipi mai-a peipi dingin li ta-a om galkap pawl lite’ cin dingin ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thong sungah Peter a kikhum laitahin hlattuom pawlpi mite in ama adingin Pasien kungah nahpi tahin thu a ngetpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Herod in Peter a lahkhiet ding kuon tuami zan ma-in siakhau gui ni tawh a kikhisa-in galkap nite kikalah Peter lum a, kot mai-ah thongcingte in a cing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ’ vantungmi khat thakhatin kilang a, thong inn sung teng khuovah khat in a tanvah hi. Vantungmi in Peter a pang behpieh a, “Mallangin tho in,” ci-in a phong leh a khuta siakhaute a kiphelmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantungmi in, “Na kawnggah gah inlen na kedap bul in,” a ci bangin ama in zong a bawl hi. Tua ciengin vantungmi in, “Na puonzal vat inlen ei zui in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Peter zong pusuohin ama a zui hi; ama in tua vantungmi’ huna tawh a pieng thu teng a tahtah ahi lam a thei vateh sih a, mangmu-in a kingaisun lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A khatna le a nina thongcingte a kal zaw ciengun khuopi sung lutna siakotpi mai a tung uhi. Tua kotpi ama thu-in ama gel adingin kihong a, tuale ama gel pusuohin lampi khat a zui laitahun vantungmi in thakhatin Peter a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Peter khuophawh a, “Tu-in Topa in a vantungmi sawlin, Herod’ khut sung pan le Judah-te’ kinepna zosie sung panin ei hunkhie zo hi, ci thu ka theicien ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in tam thu a thei behin a mindang khat Mark a kici John’ nu Mary inn ah haw a, tua sungah mi tampi kikhawmin thu a na ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a pulam kot a kiu leh a dawng dingin Roda kici nasem numei khat a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua nu in Peter’ aw ahi lam a thei bepin a kipah seng ziehin kot honpieh tah zawh sangin inn sungah tai-in Peter kotah ding hi, ci-in a va gen ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in tua nu kungah, “A maw na mah!” a ci uhi. Hizongle tua nu in a om tahtah ma ahi hi, a ci paupau ciengin amate in, “Ama’ vantungmi hi bo va,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua sung tengin Peter in kot a kiukiu hi; tuale amate in kot a hon ciengun ama a mu vua, lamdang a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a ham lo nadingun amate a khut tawh lah a, Topa in thong sung panin ama a lahkhiet dan teng a gen hi. Ama in, “James le thu um mite kungah tam thu va gen ta un,” a ci be lai hi. Tua ciengin ama in tua mun nuasie-in mundangah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zing ciengin galkapte lahah Peter bangci ta ahei, ci thu buoina lienpi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod in ama suisahin a mu lo bepin thongcingte thu sit a, tuale tha dingin amate thu a pie hi. Tua ciengin Judea gam panin Caesarea khuo-ah Herod peisuhin tua munah a tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in Tyre le Sidon mite tungah Herod lungthah mama hi. Tuaci’n amate kithutuoh tahin ama kungah a pei uhi. Amau’ gam pen kumpipa’ gama anneh ding puasui ahi bo ziehun amate in kumpi’ inn sunga vaihawm ulien Blastus a zol zaw ciengun kilemna ding a ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kiciem ni a tun ciengin Herod in a kumpi puontuol sil a, kumpi’ topha tungah to-in amate kungah thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin mite in, “Tam pen mihing’ aw ahi sih a, pasien khat’ aw ahi hi!” ci-in a awng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Herod in Pasien’ min a phat lo ziehin thakhatin Pasien’ vantungmi khat in ama a ci nasah a, than in netumin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ thu khangin thuzui mi a pung semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A nasep uh a man zaw ciengun Barnabas le Saul in a mindang khatah Mark a kici pa John zawpi-in Jerusalem ah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Antioch khuo-a hlattuom pawlpi sungah kamsangte le siete a om uhi: Tuate pen Barnabas, Niger kici Simeon, Cyrene khuo mi Lucius, gam uhpa Herod’ thukhen zuma vaihawm pa khat ahi Manaen le Saul ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa bie-in an tangin a op laitahun Hlagau Siengtho in, “Amate in kei adingin ka hlatna nasep a sem dingin Barnabas le Saul ei tuomkhen pieh un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in zong an tangin thu a nget zaw ciengun ama gel tungah a khut uh nga-in a sawlkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Hlagau Siengtho sawl ahi ziehin Seleucia khuo ah a peisuh uhi; tua panin tembaw tawh Cyprus tuikul-ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salamis khuo a tun ciengun Jew mite kikhopna inn sungah Pasien’ thu a hil uhi. John zong amate hu dingin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua tuikul tung zosie-ah a zin kawikawi vua, Paphos khuo a tun dong uh a pei zaw ciengun Bar-Jesus a kici aisan siem Judah kamsang zuou khat tawh a kituoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama pen a pil mama gam uhpa Dergius Paulus tawh a omton hi. Tua gam uhpa in Pasien’ thu a zah nop ziehin Barnabas le Saul a hlansah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua mitphiel siempa Elymas (azieh pen tua khu ama’ min kiletkhietna ahi hi) in amate na langpan a, tua upna panin gam uhpa heikhiet ding a hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Paul a kici Saul zong Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidimin Elimas limtahin en a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Dawimangpa’ tapa, thudih zosie’ galpa, solna le tatsietna namcin tawh a kidim pa aw, a tang Topa’ lampite a kawi-a na bawl pen tawp nai lo ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai in, tu-in Topa’ khut in nang ang langpang a, na mit taw-in bakhat sung khuo na mu thei sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Thakhatin meii le khuomiel in a tuom ziehin tua pa in a khuta a kai ding mi a sui kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A piengsa thute a mu ciengin gam uhpa in a um pai hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama in Topa’ thuhilnate lamdang a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paphos panin Paul le a lawmte tembaw tung tuongin Pamphylia gam Perga khuo a tung uhi. Ahi vangin tua khuo panin John in amate nuasie-in Jerusalem ah a kilekia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin Perga panin amate peisuohin Pisidia gam Antioch a tung uhi. Tuale sabbath ni-in kikhopna inn sungah amate lutin a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in thukham laibu le kamsangte’ laibute a sim zaw ciengun biehinn uhpa in amate kungah mi sawlin, “Sanggamte aw, mite adingin hanthotna thu na gen nop uleh gen un,” a cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n Paul dingto a, a khut vihin thugen kipan a, “No Israel-te le Pasien giing midangte aw, ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tami Israel-te’ Pasien in i pu i pate na teel a, Egypt leitanga a op lai-un minam lien khatin na bawl a, tua gam panin a kilamto ama’ banhat tawh amate na peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in gamlahah kum sawmli sung amate a na oppi kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Canaan gam sunga om minam sagite a suhsiet zaw ciengin a luo dingun a gam uh amate a pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kum zali sung bang a luosah hi. Tua zaw ciengin ama in kamsang Samuel khang dongin amate tungah thukhente a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kumpi khat a ngen vua, Pasien in kum sawmli sung amau’ kumpi dingin Benjamin minam sung panin Kish’ tapa Saul a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul a hepkhiet zaw ciengin ama in a kumpi dingun David ahisah hi. Ama’ thu a teci panna sungah ama in, ‘Ka deina zosie a sem dingin ka lungsim a su Jesse’ tapa David ka mu zo hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien in a kamciemsa bangin tam mipa’ suonlehlahte sung panin Israel mite tungah Gumpa Jesu a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama’ pei masangin John in Israel mi zosie tungah mawna pana kisiakiana tawh kisai baptize na thu na hil zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale John in a sep ding teng a zaw kuon ciengin, ‘Kei koi hi va nei ci vuoi? Kei tua pa ka hi sih hi. Ka nua-ah mi khat ang pei lai ding hi; ama’ kenga a kedap gui sutpieh dingin zong ka kilawm sih hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Abraham innkuon’ suonlehlah ka sanggamte le note lahah Pasien a giing midangte aw, note kungah tami hutdamna thu ang kipuoh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem-a tengte le a makaite un ama hile sabbath ni siela kisim kamsangte’ thugente hile a thei lo ziehun, amate in ama tunga mawmatna tawh tua thute a na tangtungsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in sina thukhenna ding za-in ama tungah thu mu sih nan ule Pilat kungah a kitha thei nading a na ngen paupau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’ thu a kigiel zosie a tangtunsah zaw ciengun singkhuom tung panin ama lakhie-in hankhuh sungah a siel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in misite lah panin ama thosah zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tuale Galilee gam panin Jerusalem dong ama a zawpi mite kungah ni tampi sung kilah a, amate tu-in mite mai-ah teci ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ko ka hi ule Pasien in i pu i pate tunga a na ciemsa lungdamna thu ang puoh ka hi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />ei a tate adingin ama in Jesu a thawsahkiana tawh a tangtun zo hi. Late dawng nina sungah zong, ‘Nang ka Tapa na hi hi; tuni-in nang kang piengsah zo hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Muotna a zuonkia nawn lo dingin misite lah panin ama a thawsahkiana tawh kisai-in ama in, ‘David tunga ka ciemsa a siengtho kamciemte nangma kang pie ding hi,’ ci-in tam bangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Late mundang khatah zong, ‘Na Misiengtho Pa muotna na thuohsah sih ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile David in a khan sungin Pasien’ deina banga na a sep zaw ciengin si a, a pu a pate gei-ah kivui-in muotna a thuoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ahi vangin Pasien in a thawsah pa ahile muotna thuoh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka sanggamte aw, tam mipa ziehin note tungah mawmaisahna thu ang kitangko ahina thu kithei taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tami Jesu ziehin Moses’ thukham zieha na suotah thei lona uh mawna zosie panin na suohta zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note tungah kamsangte’ thugen ang tun lo nadingin kidawm un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />‘No mi zakote aw, en un! Lamdang sa unlen, mangthai ta un, azieh pen mi khat in na kung vua ang gen leh na up ngai vawt lo ding uh nasep khat na hin sungun ka bawl ding hi,’ ci-in a hil hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas a pusuo laitahun mite in sabbath ni kia ciengin tam thute ei gen in,” ci-in a zawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Kikhopna a man zaw ciengin Judah mi tampite le Judah biehna pana a kikhelsa a kipumpieh mite in Paul le Barnabas a zui vua, ama gel in zong Pasien’ hepina sungah tua mite a op den nadingun thu hilin a hanthawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Sabbath ni kia ciengin a khuozang phielin Topa’ thu ngai dingin a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hinanle Jew mite in mihonpi a mu ciengun a thangsie mama vua, tuale amate in Paul’ thugen langpangin a gensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Paul le Barnabas in hangtahin thu a gen tuoh vua, “Kote in na kung vuah Pasien’ thu kang gen masah ding uh a kisam hi. Note in tua thu nielin hin tawntungna nga dinga kilawm na kisah lo ziehun tu-in Gentile-te kungah ka kihei ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in eite thu ei pie a, ‘Leimong dongah hutdamna thu na puoh thei nadingun, Gentile-te tungah khuovah ahi dingin note kang koi zo ta hi’ ei ci hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Gentile-te in tam thu a zah ciengun lungdamin Topa’ thu a patawi uhi. Kumtawn hinna a nga dinga a kisesa zaza in thu a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua bangin gam buppi-ah Topa’ thu a kizel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jew mite in Pasien’ thu a hakat, a zatahhuoi numeite le khuopi sunga om makaite a hantawh vua, tuaci’n Paul le Barnabas bawlsiesahin a gam panun a notmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a keng vua leivuite thingin Iconium khuo ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nuazuite ahi ule Hlagau Siengtho tawh kidimin a kipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Iconium khuo Jew mite kikhopna inn ah Paul le Barnabas lutin tua bang danin ama gel in thu a hil uh ciengin Jew mite le Greek-te tampitah thu um mi a suoh vua, tuaci’n tua khuo sungah a piengsa thu teng ma a piengkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin thu um lo Jew mite in Gentile-te holtuo-in a sanggamte ledo dingin lungsim hoi lo a guon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n sauveipitah a tam vua, Topa adingin amate in hangtahin thu a hil uhi. Ama’ hepina thu teci a pang sawltahpite tungtawnin Topa in amate tungah lim le na lamdangte bawl theina thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuo sunga teng mite a kiphalsuo vua, pawlkhat in Jew mite panpi-in adang pawlkhat in sawltahpite a panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gentile-te le Jew mite in a uliente utawh sawltahpite bawlsie-in suong tawh se ding a hanciem vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />sawltahpite in tua thu a thei ciengun Lycaonia khuopite ahi Lystra, Derbe le a kima gamah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua gamah lungdamna thuhil a zomsuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lystra khuo ah a suocil a kipan a keng a zang thei lo, lam zong pei thei loin a mawh to mi khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paul in thu a gen laitahin tua pa in a ngai hi. Tuale Paul in limtahin en a, tua pa in dam thei nading upna a nei lam mu ahi ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na keng tawh dingtang in,” ci-in nahpi-in a kiko leh tua pa kitomin lam pei a kipan pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Paul’ nasepsate mihonpite in a mu ciengun amate in Lyconia-te’ ham tawh, “Eite kungah mihing mel puo-in pasien-te ang kumsuh uhi!” ci-in nahpitahin a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in Barnabas pen Zeus ci-in a minvaw vua, Paul pen a thugenpi pen ahi ziehin Hermes ci-in minvaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuo pulama a om Zeus pasien’ siempu pa in tunkotah bawngtang le paakuolte peipi a, ama le mihonpi in kithoina a bawl nop lam uh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sawltahpite ahi Barnabas le Paul in a zah ciengun a puon uh balkehin mihonpi lahah tai-in a kiko vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lawmte aw, bang dinga tam bang na bawl uh ahei? Ko zong noma banga mihing ma ka hi bo uhi. Kimanna a nei lo tami nate panin van le lei, tuipi le a sunga om na zosie a siem a hingzing Pasien lama na kihei nadingun note tungah lungdamna thu ang puoh ka hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khanglui lai-in minam zosie in a deina uh lampi ciet a zui ding uh ama in a phal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle ama in sil hoi a bawlna sungah teci om loin a nuasie sih a, ama in note tungah vantung panin guotui le khuohun hoite hing pie-in, an le tui zong ang kidimsah a, na lungtang uzong kipahna tawh ang kidimsah hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam bang thute nangawn tawh ama gel tungah kithoina a bawl lo nadingun mihonte a khah zo lieiliei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Antioch le Iconium khuo panin tua munah Jew mite pei-in mihonpi a thuzaw gawp uhi. Tua ciengin amate in suong tawh Paul a sep gawp vua, a si hi ta va ci-in khuo pulamah a kaiphit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin nuazuite in ama a kimkot ciengin ama zong tho-in khuo sungah a lut hi. A zing ciengin Derbe khuo ah Barnabas tawh a peisuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in tua khuo ah lungdamna thu a gen vua, mi tampitah nuazui a suohsah zaw uh ciengin Iconium le Antioch lamah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum tahah nuazuite thakhausahin upna sungah a amate a kip den nadingun a hanthawn vua, “Pasien’ manggam sungah i lut thei nadingin bawlsietna tampi i thuoh ding uh kul hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama gel in hlattuom pawlpi simah hlattuom pawlpi upate a koipieh zaw ciengun, a muonte uh thungetna le antanna tawh Topa tungah a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Pisidia gam a nawh vua, tuaci’n Pamphylia gam a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Perga khuo ah Pasien’ thu a gen zaw uh ciengin Attalia khuo ah a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua khuo panin a muolsuosa uh nasep a sem dinga Pasien’ hepina sunga a ki-apna uh ahi Antioch lam zuonin tembaw tawh a peikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua mun a tun ciengun hlattuom pawlpi mite a kaikhawm vua, Pasien in amate tungtawna a sep zosie le Gentile-te adinga upna kot a honpiehna thute a sut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua khuo ah nuazuite tawh sawtveipi a tam uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judea gam panin mi pawlkhat a hawsuh vua, “Moses’ ngaina tawh kizui-in na tep uh na tan sih uleh note in hutdamna na nga thei sih ding uhi,” ci-in amate in sanggamte thu a hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in amate tawh nahpitahin kinielna le kiselna a nei zaw ciengun, tam thudawhna tawh kisai-in sawltahpite le upate tawh Jerusalem ah peito-in thu kikum dingin Paul, Barnabas, le adang pawlkhat kise hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n hlattuom pawlpi in lampi-ah amate a va hla ta vua, Phoenicia gam le Samaria gam a kantan kawmun Gentile-te a kikhelna uh thu a zasah vua, tuaci’n amate in thu um mi zosie a nuomsah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem a tun ciengun hlattuom pawlpi mite, sawltahpite, le upate in amate a na dawn vua, amate tung tawnin Pasien’ nasepna zosie a zasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pharisee pawlte sung panin thu um mi pawlkhat ding to-in, “Amate in Moses’ thukham zui-in a tep uh a tan nadingun thu i pieh uh kul hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami thu a lungngai dingin sawltahpite le upate a kikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sawtveipi a kisel zaw ciengun Peter zong dingto a, “Sanggamte aw, kei tung panin Gentile-te in lungdamna thu za-in thu um mi a suo thei nadingun sawtveipi lai panin note lahah Pasien in kei ei teelna thu na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihingte’ lungtang sung a thei Pasien in eite tunga ei pieh bang lienin amate tungah zong Hlagau Siengtho a piehna tawh teci a pang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate le eite kikalah khentuom nei loin upna tawh amau’ lungsim a siengthosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin nuazuite ngawngah i pu i pate le eite in i puoh zawh lo uh hahkol suonin bang dingin Pasien ze-et ding i hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bang ding ahi sih hi. Topa Jesu’ hepina ziehin eite ei kihundam ding hi, ci-in i up ma bangin amate zong kihundam ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Paul le Barnabas in ama gel tungtawnin Pasien in Gentile-te lahah lim le na lamdang a bawlsa zosie a gen laitahun a kikhawm mihon vannuoi in sip dide-in a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thugen uh a man zaw ciengin James in, “Sanggamte aw, ka thugen na ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien in a min adingin amate sung panin kimkhat a teelkhiet nadingin, a masa-in bangci bangin Gentile-te tungah maipha pie ahei ci thute Simeon in ang gen zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kamsangte’ thugente tam tawh kituoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />‘Tua zaw ciengin kang peikia ding a, a puasa David’ tenna inn ka lam kia ding hi; a kisiesate panin ka lamkia ding a, ka tungding kia ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuaci’n midangte le ka mina kihlan Gentile-te zosie nangawn in Topa a sui ding uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ci-in tanglai peh panin tam thute ei theisah Topa in a gen hi,’ ci-in kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kote in Pasien lamah ang kihei Gentile-te suhbuoi lo zawh ding khensatna ka nei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuale mahin amate in milim biehna, numei-pasal pahtatna, lawlmeh sa popo le sisan nehnate panin amate a kibuasah lo nadingun lai hlahzaw leih pha ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sabbath nisielin kikhopna innte-ah Moses’ thukhamte ma a gingin kisim ngitnget a, tanglai peh panin zong khuo cin tengah ama’ thugente ma hil penin kinei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin sawltahpite, upate le hlattuom pawlpi buppi in amate sung panin mi pawlkhat teelin Antioch khuo ah Paul le Barnabas peitonsah dingin a khensat uhi. Amate in sanggamte lahah makai ahi Barsabbas a kici Judas le Silas a sawl vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tam bangin lai gielin a puosah uhi: “Sanggamte aw, sawltahpite le upate in Antioch khuo-a kipanin Syria gam le Cylicia gama om Gentile mi-a pieng thu um mite kang hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ko sawl lopi-in ko kung panin mi pawlkhat a piekhie vua, no buoi nading thute genin na lungsim uh ang amsah zo uhi, ci thu ka na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kote in na kung vua kang sawl ding uh tangmite ka teel vua, tuale Barnabas le Paul tawh ang zawhton dingin lungkimtahin ka khensat zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama gel pen i Topa Jesu Khris’ min ziehin a hinna uh a pie ngamte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate mama in a kam utawh tam thute ma ang gen dingin Judas le Silas kang sawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen kote in tam thupoimawte sanga a gihzaw vangih dang note tunga kang guonbe lo nading uh, Hlagau Siengtho le kote in hoi ka sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua a kisam thute in: Milim kithoina ante, sisan, a kilawlmeh sa, le numei-pasal pahtatnate na tan ding uh ahi hi. Tam teng na tan zawh nah po uleh note adingin hoikhop ta lel hi. Na damta un,” ci-in lai a hlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate sawlin Antioch khuo ah a peisuh uhi. Amate in mipi a kaikhop zaw ciengun tua laihlah a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawlpi mite in laihlah a sim ciengun hanthawtnate ziehin amate lungdam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate mama zong kamsang ahi Judas le Silas-te in thu tampitah a gen vua, thu um mite hanthawnin a thakhausah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua tahah amate bakhat sung a tam zaw ciengun thu um mite in amate a sawlkhie mite kungah lungnuom tahin a peisahkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanle tua munah Silas a tam lai ding hoi a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin Antioch khuo ah Paul le Barnabas-te a tam vua, amate in midang tampite tungah Topa’ thu a tangko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni phabep khat zaw ciengin Paul in Barnabas kungah, “Hing pei in, peikia vai-in, Topa’ thu i hilnasa khuopi zosie-a om thu um mite kungah haw-in bang a ci vuoi mah va en tavai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Barnabas in Mark kici John zawpi nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vang in Paul in Pamphylia khuo ah amate nuasie-in a nasepna vua a zui nuom lo mipa zawpi lo dingin a khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kinah niel luo uh ahi ziehin a kikhenlaw vawt uhi; Barbabas in Mark a zawpi a, tembaw tawh Cyprus tuikul ah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hizongle Paul in Silas teel a, Topa’ hepina sungah thu um mite in ama apin a kuonkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Syria gam le Cilicia gam nawhin ama pei-in hlattuom pawlpite a thakhausah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul peisuoh lai-in Derbe le Lystra khuo ah a tung a, tua munah thu um Jew mi numei khat’ tapa Timothy a kici nuazui khat a om hi; ahi vangin a pa pen Greek mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lystra le Iconium khuo-a thu um mite in ama a genpha mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in Timothy a kithuopi nuom hi; tua mun tenga a teng Jew mite ziehin tua pa zawpi-in a tep a tanpieh hi, azieh pen amate in a pa Greek mi ahi lam a unpi-un a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuopi khat pan khuopi khat zin kawikawi-in Jerusalem-a sawltahpite le upate in zui dinga khensatna a bawlsate uh amate tungah a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n upna sungah hlattuom pawlpite thahatsahin nisimin thu um mimal a khang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hlagau Siengtho in Asia gam sungah Pasien thu a hil ding uh phal lo ahi ziehin Phrygia le Galatia gam tengah a zin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mysia gamgi a tun uh ciengin Bithynia gam a lut sawm vangun Jesu’ Hlagau in amate a phal sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaci’n Mysia gam nawt suohin Troas khuo ah a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zanlai-in Paul in mang khat a mu hi; tua munah Macedonia mi khat dingin, “Macedonia gamah hing galkai inlen kote ei hu in,” ci-in a thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in mang a mu zaw ciengin amate kungah lungdamna thu a tangko dingin Pasien in eite ei hlan zo hi, ci-in ngaisun ka hi ziehun Macedonia galkai ding thakhatin ka sawm pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Troas khuo panin gunkuong tung tuongin Samothrace tuikul lam zuonin tangtahin ka pei vua, a zing ni-in Neapolis khuo tungin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua mun panin Macedonia gamkhen sunga khuo thupi pen le Rome mite tenna Philipi khuo ah ka tung uhi. Tami khuo ah ni tampi sung ka tam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabbath ni-in khuopi tunkot pulamah ka pusuoh vua, thungetna mun hi kha ding hi, ci-a ka upmawna uh gun gei lamah ka pei uhi; tuale ka to vua, khum sunga a kikhawm numeite tawh ka kiholim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien a bie Lydia a kici numei khat in ka thugen uh a ngai hi; tua nu pen Thyatira pana puon dupsan zua ahi hi. Ama in Paul’ thugente lawp tahin a ngai thei nadingin Topa in a lungsim a honpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A innkuonpite tawh a ki-baptize ciengin ama in kei kungah, “Note in kei, Topa adingin mi muonhuoi khat a nei ngaisut uleh hing pei unlen ka inn ah hing tung ta un,” ci-in ei zawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nikhat, thungetna mun zuona ka pei laitahun, dawi lawm nei, mailam thugenna tawh a pute sum tampi a suipieh sila numei khat tawh ka kituoh kha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua nu in Paul le ko ei zui laitahin, “Tam mite pen na kung vua hutdamna lampi ang tangko Sangpen Pasien’ silate ahi uhi,” ci-in ang kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua bangin ni tampi sung a awng den mielmuol hi. Ahi vangin Paul in tuapa seda mama a, tuale ama kihei-in tua hlagau kungah, “Tam nu sung panin na pusuo nadingin Jesu Khris’ minin thu kang pie hi,” a ci hi. Tua hun lien ma-in tua hlagau a pusuoh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pute in a sum mu nading uh lametna tawp zo hi, ci-in a thei bepun amate in Paul le Silas-te a man vua, tuale vanzuana mun thuneite mai-ah a kaiphit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thukhenmangte kung a tut uh ciengin amate in, “Tam mite in i khuo sung a buoisah uhi; ama gel pen Jew mite ahi vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tuale kote Rome mi ka hina utawh ko adingin pom ding le zui dinga kilawm lo ngainate ei hil uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mihonpite in ama gel a vuohpi valuoi vua, tuale thukhenmangte in zong a puon uh hawhmang piehin ciengpum tawh a sat nadingun thu a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in nahpitahin a sat zaw ciengun thong sungah a khum vua, hoitaha a cin nadingin thongcing pa a vaihlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thongcing pa in zong tam kivaihlahnate ma bangin thonginn sungtawng penah ama gel koi-in kengkol a bul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zankim pawlin Paul le Silas in thu ngenin Pasien tungah phatna late a sa vua, tuale thongkiete in a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thakhatin zil ling a, tua zil a natsiet seng ziehin thonginn a zung dongin a lawhthing gawp hi. Thakhatin kotkhah zosie kihong a, mi zosiete’ kikhina siakhaute a kiphel sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thongcing pa zong khanglo-in thong kotpi zosie kihong sa-a om a mu bepin, thongkie zosie a pit sieng hi ta va, ci-in ngaisun a, tua ziehin a namsau dawhin ama le ama a kithat dingin a kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi vangin Paul in, “Nang le nang bangma kilaw sin, azieh pen tanah ka unpi-un ka om uhi,” ci-in a aw neiza tawh a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thongcing pa in meivah ngenin thong sung a nawlut pai a, Paul le Silas-te mai-ah a citunsa-in a khupbawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama gel a pusuopi a, tuale ama in, “Siete aw, hutdamna ka nga nadingin bang bawl ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama gel in, “ Topa Jesu um in, tua hile nang le na innkuonpite in hutdamna na nga ding uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama gel in tua pa kung le a inn sunga om mi zosie kungah Topa’ thu a hil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khum zan tua hun lien ma-in tua pa in ama gel peipi-in a maliemte uh a sawp siengpieh hi; tua ciengin ama le a innkuonpite zosie a ki-baptize pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A inn ah ama gel peipi-in a mai vuah ankuong zong a lui hi; tuale ama pen Pasien sunga thu um mi khat hi ta ahi ziehin ama le a innkuon buppi a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin thukhenmangte in palih khat sawlin, “Tua mite hlakhie ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Thongcing pa in Paul kungah thu puoh a, “Thukhenmangte in no gel hla nadingin kam ei kivaihlah zo hi; tua ziehin tu-in pusuoh unlen lungnuom tahin pei ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ahi vangin Paul in, “Amate in Rome gammi ahi kote, mawsahna thu om lopi-in mizapi mai-ah ei satin thong ei khie uhi; tu-in zong koima’ thei lo-in ei dap hla sawm uh amah? Hi thei lo ding hi! Amate mama hing pei-in ei hla uheh,” ci-in a dawngkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Palihte in thukhenmangte kungah tam thute a ko vua, amate Rome gammi ahi uh a zah bepun a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama gel kungah amate pei-in a va thum ta vua, thong panin ama gel la dawhin khuopi a nuasie nadingun a zawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thong panin a peikhiet zaw ciengun Lydia inn ah a haw uhi; sanggam pasal le sanggam numeite tawh tua munah kimu-in a hanthot zaw cieng gelin tua panin a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul le Silas-te in Amphipolis le Apollonia khuote nawhin Judah-te’ kikhopna inn opna Thessalonica khuo a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pei ngaina ma bangin kikhopna inn sungah Paul tumin, Lai Siengtho pansie-in sabbath ni thum sung amate tawh thu kikum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Messiah in gimna thuohin misite lah panin a thawkia ding a kisapna thute hilcienin lahtel a, “Note kunga kang tangko Jesu khu Messiah ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate pawlkhat lunglutin Paul le Silas a pawl vua, tua ma bangin Pasien a giing Greek mi tampite le numei makai tampi in zong a pawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jew mite haza-in vanzuana muna om migilote pawlkhat a ciel vua, tuaci’n amate in mihonpi khawmin khuopi sung a buoisah uhi. Mihonpi mai-a kaikhiet dingin Paul le Silas a sui laitahun amate in Jason’ inn a bulu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama gel a mul zo lo bepun amate in Jason le thu umte pawlkhat kaiphitin khuopi thuneite’ mai-ah a tut vua, “Leitung kikhulehsah tam mite tami munah zong ang tung ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jason in a inn ah amate zin a tungsah hi. Amate in a unpi-un kumpipa’ thupiehte tawh a kikelbulin a gamta vua, Jesu a kici kumpi dang khat om hi, a ci uhi,” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipite le khuosung uliente in tami thu a zah ciengun a buoi mama vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tuale amate in Jason le adangte tat nading sum a lah zaw ciengun a hlakhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua zan ma-in thu um mite in Beroea khuo ah Paul le Silas a peisah uhi; ama gel a tun ciengun Jew-te’ kikhopna inn sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thessalonica-te sangin tami Juda mite in Pasien’ thu a sang theizaw uhi, azieh pen amate in Pasien’ thu kigente lunglut tahin pomin tua a kigen thute ahi ma amah, ci-in nisielin Lai Siengtho tawh a sittel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amate tampi in Pasien’ thu a um vua, tua mite lahah Greek numei tawmno khat le dinmun sangpi a nei Greek pasalte zong a kihal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle Beroea khuo-ah zong Paul in Pasien’ thu tangko zo hi, ci Thessalonica khuo-a Jew mite in a thei ciengun amate zong tuanah pei-in mipite holtuo-in a satsuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin thu um mite in tuipi lamah thakhatin Paul a hladap vua, ahi vangin Silas le Timothy-te a tam lai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Paul a zawpi mite in Athen cieng dong a hla uhi; tuale Silas le Timothy-te in a gang theithei-in Paul ang pawlkia nading uh thu vaihlahna a nga zaw uh ciengin a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama gel ngahin Athen khuo ah Paul a op laitahin milim tawh a kidim tua khuo mu-in a lungsim a na mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in kikhopna inn sungah Jew mite le Pasien a zatah mite thu kuppi a, vanzuana munah a kituopi khah mite tawh zong nisielin thu a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuthuh pilna nei Epicurea le Stoic-te pawlkhat ama tawh thu a kiniel uhi. Pawlkhat in, “Tami a kipilsah thu mawh gengen pa khu bang gen nuom ahiei?” a ci uhi. A dangte in, gamdang pasien-te’ thu gen hile kilawm ve aw,” a ci uhi. (Ama in Jesu’ Lungdamna thu le thawkiana thu a gen zieh ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Paul hlanin Areopagus mun a tut vua, “Kote in na gengen tami thuhilna tha ka theithei ding vuoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kote adingin thu tuomdang pi khat ahi a, bang a ci nopna ahei ka thei nuom uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in Athen khuomi zosie le tua khuo-a a teng gamdang mi zosie in thu tha pawlkhat genna ding ahi sihle tua thute ngaina ding ci simlo, a hunte uh bangma dangin a zang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Areopagus mai-ah Paul ding a, “Athen mite aw, biehna thu a pawnthaw mama mite na hina uh pen na gamtatna zosie vuah kang thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile khuo sung muncin tengah vah kawikawi-in na bieh uh nate ka cienvel ciengin maitam tung khatah, ‘A kithei kha lo pasien ading,’ ci-a kigiel lai khat ka mu hi. Tua ahi ziehin na kung vuah thei khah lopi-a na bieh pa uh ang tangko ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitung le a sunga a om na vannuoi a siem Pasien pen lei le van a uh Topa ahi a, ama pen mihingte’ khut tawh a kibawl biehbuhte sungah teng lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama ma in mi zosie tungah hinna, nahuu le na vannuoi a pieh ziehin ama pen tasap khatpo a nei bang danin mihingte’ khut in ama’ na a seppieh ding kisam lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in pupi khat tung panin leitung buppi a luo dingin minam zosie bawl a, amau’ hin tanvei ding le amau’ tenna ding gamgite sesa-in a koipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua khu amate in Pasien sui-in a mu thei khah uleh ci deina ahi a, ahi vangin ama ahile i kung ciet panin a gamla op sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile, ‘Ama sungah eite nungta-in i pia valiai vua, mihing hina i nei uhi,’ kici a, na laphuote uh pawlkhat nangawn in, ‘Azieh pen eite zong ama’ hlah le suonte i hi uhi,’ na na ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Eite i hi ule Pasien’ tate i hi ziehun i Pasien pen mihingte’ khutsiemna le ngaisutna in a bawl le a zep ngun le kham, suongtumte le milimte tawh a kibanga i ngaisut ding uh a kilawm sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihingte’ thei lo hun lai-in Pasien in phamaw a na sa sih a, tu-in ahile ama in mun zosie-a om mi zosie a kisiakia nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in a sesa mipa tungtawnin dihna tawh thu a khen nading ni khat a sekhol zo hi. Misite lah panin ama a thawsahkiana tawh tami thu a man a hina mi zosie tungah hla muonna a pie zo hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in a sisa mite thawkiana thu a zah ciengun pawlkhat in a simmawbawl uhi; ahi vangin adangte in, “Tami thu khatvei za nuom lai ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua laitahin Paul in amate a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate kimkhat in ama panpi-in thu um mi a suoh vua, tuate lahah Areopagus’ pawlmi Dionysius, le Damaris a kici numei khat le adangte kihal hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin Athen nuasie-in Corinth khuo ah Paul a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah ama in Pontus gammi Aquila kici Judah mi khat mu a, ama pen Claudius in Rome gam nuasie dingin Jew mite zosie thupie zo ahi ziehin a zinu Priscilla tawh Italy gam pana ang tun uh a sawt nai lo ahi hi. Ama gel tawh kimu dingin Paul pei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ama zong ama gel tawh a nasep a kibah ziehin a inn vuah tungin na a semton uhi, ama gel pen puonbuh khui nasep semte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sabbath nisielin ama in kikhopna inn ah Jew mite le Greek-te zawl sawmin thu a kikuppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Macedonia gam panin Silas le Timothy a tun ciengin Paul thuhil lamah kitahla-in Messiah in Jesu ahi hi, ci-in Jew mite kungah teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in ama langpangin a gensiet ciengun Paul in a puon tunga leivui bangte thingin amate kungah, “Na lutung vuah na sisan uh tu taheh! Kei maw ka peng hi. Tu-a kipanin Gentile-te kungah ka pei ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in kikhopna mun nuasie-in Titius Justus a kici Pasien bie pa khat’ inn ah a tung hi; a inn pen kikhopna inn gei mama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kikhopna inn uhpa Crispus le a innkuonpi zosie in Topa a um uhi; tuale Paul’ thugen a za Corinth-te tampitah zong thu um mi suohin a ki-baptize uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan khat Paul in mang mu a, ama’ mang sungah Topa in, “Zau sin, thu gen inlen dai op zaw sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />keima in nang kang ompi ziehin na tungah koima in a khut hlangin ang liemsah sih ding hi, azieh pen tami khuo sungah mi tampi ka nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum tahah kum khat le hlaguh tamin amate lahah Pasien’ thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Gallio pen Achaia gam uhpa ahi ciengin Jew mite in kilungtuohin Paul a busim vua, thukhen zumah a tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in, “Tam pa in thukham tawh kilebulin Pasien bie dingin mite a zawl hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thugen dingin Paul a kisah laitahin Gallio in Jew mite kungah, “Jew mite aw, tami thu pen gamtat khielna le gitlona thu khat popo ahile na thu uh kang ngaisut pieh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahi vangin tami thu pen kammal zatziete po, minte po le na thukham zieh po vua a pieng thute ahi bo ziehin no le no in vaihawm zaw un; tami thute ah thukhenmang ka sem nuom sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale ama in thukhen zum panin amate a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in kikhopna inn uhpa Sosthenes manin thukhenna zum mai-ah a unpi-un a satgawp uhi. Ahi vangin Gallio in tua thute phamaw a sa vet sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua munah sawtveipi sung a tam zaw ciengin Paul in thu um mite mangpha a pai a, Priscilla le Aquila tawh tembaw tung tuongin Syria gam zuonin a pei hi. Ama in kiciemna khat nei ahi ziehin Cenchreae-ah a sam a heu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ephesus khuo a tun ciengun Paul in tua tahah Priscilla le Aquila a nuasie hi. Ahi vangin amasa penin ama ma kikhopna inn ah lutin Jew mite tawh thu kikupna a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in a sawt tam dingin a hlo uleh ama in a khia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin amate tawh a kikhen ding ciengin, “Pasien deina a op leh na kung vuah kang zinkia ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Ephesus khuo panin tembaw tawh ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Caesarea khuo a tun ciengin Jerusalem ah peito-in hlattuom pawlpite hopi a, tua ciengin Antioch-ah a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua tahah bakhat sung hun a zah zaw ciengin peikia a, Galatia le Phrygia gam sung tengah mun khat zaw mun khat pei kawikawi-in nuazui zosie a va thakhausah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in Ephesus ah Alexander khuomi Apollos a kici Judah mi khat haw hi. Ama pen mi dangnal le Lai Siengtho thei mama khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama pen Topa’ Lampi-ah zong a kisinsa ahi hi; ama in John’ baptize na thu beh a thei vangin Jesu tawh kisai thute lawptahin genin mantahin a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kikhopna inn sungah hangtahin ama thugen a kipan hi; hinanle Priscilla le Aquila-te in tua thu a zah ciengun ama hlanin a manzaw-in Pasien’ Lampi thu a hilcien uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Achaia gamah a galkai nuom ciengin thu um mite in ama a hanthawn vua, nuazuite in a na lamdot nadingun lai a hlah uhi. Tua gam a tun ciengin ama in hepina zieha thu um a na suohsa mite nahpitahin a panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in mipi mai-ah Jew mite khautahin niel gawp a, Messiah pen Jesu ahi hi, ci-in Lai Siengtho pansia-in amate a lah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Corinth khuo ah Apollos a op laitahin gam sung muncin tengah Paul zin kawikawi-in Ephesus khuo tung a, tua tahah nuazui pawlkhat tawh a kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in amate kungah, “Thu um mi na suo zaw ciengun Hlagau Siengtho na nga vuoi mah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Ka nga sih uhi, Hlagau Siengtho a op lam nangawn zong ka za ngai sih uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Tua ahile bang baptize-na na nga vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in, “John’ baptize-na ka nga uhi,” ci-in a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paul in, “John in kisiakiana tawh baptize-na pie a, ama’ nua-a pei ding pa Jesu a up nadingun mipite kungah a gen hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in tam thu a zah ciengun Topa Jesu’ min tawh a ki-baptize uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate tungah Paul in a khut a ngah zaw ciengin Hlagau Siengtho tung a, kam tuomtuom tawh hamin thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a kigawmin mi sawm le ni a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kikhopna inn sungah ama lutin hla thum sung Pasien’ manggam thu kikuppi a, mi lungsim zo theithei dingin thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat a lung uh khau a, amate in um nuom loin mipite mai-ah tua Lampi thu a gensiet ciengun amate kung panin nuazuite tawh Paul kihem dawhin Tyrannus thuhilna innpi sungah nisielin thu a kikuppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asia gam sunga a teng Jew mite le Greek-te in a unpi-un Topa’ thu a zah thei nadingun tam bangin kum ni sung a zomsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in Paul tungtawnin na lamdang thupite bawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaci’n ama’ citung tawh a kithusa mainulte hile puonte hile cinate kungah a kipeipi ciengin, a natnate uh damin amate kung panin hla gilote a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin dawi hawlkhie-a a vah kawikawi Jew mite pawlkhat in Topa Jesu’ min zah sawmin dawilut mite kungah, “Paul in a genpa Jesu’ min tawh thu kang pie hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sceva a kici Judah siempu lien pa’ tapa sagite in tua bangin a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin hla gilo in amate kungah, “Jesu ka thei a, Paul zong ka thei hi; no koi na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate tungah dawivei pa kitomin amate a unpi-un a zo gawp a, a zawthaw bawl seng ziehin puon sil loin amate a liemsa-in inn panin a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ephesus khuo-a teng Jew mite le Ephesus mite zosie in tam thu a thei ciengun zau-in Topa Jesu’ min a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thu-umsa tampite in zong a gamtatnate uh pulahin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aisan thei mi tampite in a laibute uh a khawm vua, amate in mipi’ muna-ah a haltum uhi; tua laibute a man a kituot ciengin ngun peh tul sawm nga man hi, ci kithei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa’ thu thahat tahin khangin a guolzo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tu-in tam thu zosie a pien zaw ciengin Paul in Macedonia le Achai-a gamte nawhin Jerusalem khuo ah peisuoh ding a khensat hi. Ama in, “Khumtah ka tun zaw ciengin Rome zong ka mu kul ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in Macedonia gamah ama a hu mi ni ahi Timothy le Erastus-te sawl a, Asia gam sungah bakhat sung a tam lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum hun pawlin Lampi thu tawh kisai buoina lienpi a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Demetrius a kici ngunkheng pa khat in ngun tawh Artemis biehna inn neute bawl a, khutsiemte adingin sumsuina lien mama khat a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in tua mite le a nasep uh a kibang nasemte kaikhawm a, “Guoite aw, tami nasepna panin hauna i nga lam na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tami Paul in Ephesus khuo guoh hi loin Asia gam mun zosie phielah khut tawh a kibawl pasien-te pen pasien ahi sih hi,” ci-in gen a, ama in mihon tampitah zawlin a kaimang sieng hi, ci thu zong mu-in na za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua hi a, tami i sumsui nasepna guoh ang minsie khop sih ding a, a lien mama nusien Artemis’ biehinnpi ang kisimmaw bawlin, tuale Asia gam zosie le leitunga kibie numei nu’ thupina teng zong ang maiman khah ding a zauhuoi mama hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in tam thu a zah uh ciengin a lungthah nah mama vua, “Ephesus mite’ Artemis lien mama hi!” ci-in a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuaci’n khuosung teng buoina tawh kidim a, mipite in mihon kikhopna innpi sungah Paul’ khuolzinpi Macedonia mi Gaius le Aristarhus a kaiphit uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mihonte lahah Paul pei nuom a, ahi vangin nuazuite in a lut sah sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Paul’ lawmte ahi Asia gam ulien pawlkhat nangawn in zong mihon kikhopna innpi sunga a lut lo nading uh mi sawlin a thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua hun sungin a kikhawm mite a buoi ziehun mi pawlkhat in thudang gen a, adangte in thudang khat ma genin a kiho vua, a tamzawte in bang zieha kikhawm uh ahei, ci thu a thei sih uhi. Jew mite in a mai lama a tawsawn uh Alexander pen mipite mai-ah ang tut ziehun mihon pawlkhat in a mawsah uhi. Tuale Alexander in mipite tungah a kidal nading thu gen nuom a, mipi a dai nadingin a khut a lamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in Alexander pen Judah mi khat ahi lam a thei uh ciengin, amate zosie in Ephesus mite’ Artemis lien mama hi,” ci-in kithutuoh tahin nai ni phiel bang a kiko uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hinanle khuopi lai-atpa in mihonpi a daisah zaw ciengin ama in, “Ephesus mite aw, Ephesus mite pen a lien mama nusien Artemis’ biehinn le vantung pansa ang kiesuh biehna suongcingte ahi lam uh a thei lo koi om na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tami thute pen niel thei lo thu ahi kalsie daitahin om a, ngaisutna mel a nei lo gamtatnate na bawl lo ding uh kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Note in biehinnpi bulute le i nusien-te zong a gensie lo tam mite tanah nang tut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Demetrius le a seppi khutsiemte in mi khatpo tawh thu a nei nop uleh thukhenna zumte kihong den a, thukhenmangte zong a om hi. Tuate mai-ah khatlekhat thu kinei uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Note in thu khatpopo na kan nop lai uleh ngaina bangin mipi kikhopna-ah kikhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile tam buoina thu tungah eite in bangma pansia ding thu pie thei lo i hi ziehin, tuni-a pieng buoina tawh thu ei kisit khah ding zauhuoi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in tami thu a gen zaw ciengin kikhopna a khawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua buoina a ven zaw ciengin Paul in nuazuite hlanin a hanthot zaw ciengin mangpha pai-in Macedonia gamah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua gam tengah ama zin kawikawi a, thu um mite hanthotna tampi a pieh zaw ciengin Greek gamah tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua munah hla thum sung a tam hi. Tembaw tawh Syria gam pei ding a kisah laitahin Jew mite in ama a tha sawm ziehun Macedonia gam tawnin kilekia ding a khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Beroea khuomite Pyrrhus’ tapa Sopater, Thessalonica khuomi Aristarchus le Secundus, Derbe khuo mite Gaius le Timothy, Asia gam pan Tychicus le Trophimus-te in ama a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate na mapei-in Troas khuo ah ei na ngah uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahi vangin Tolsawlo Anlum Pawi a ven zaw ciengin tembaw tawh Philippi panin ka peikhie vua, ni nga sungin Troas khuo ah amate ka pha vua, tua munah ni sagi sung ka tam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nipi kalkhat sung a ni masa pen ni-in, khomun balnen dingin ka kikhop uh ciengin Paul in amate tawh kikupna khat a bawl hi; a zing ciengin ama a pei sawm ziehin zankim dongin a thugen a zomsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kikhopna uh innkhan tungnung ah meivah tampi kivah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paul in thu a sawtgen kikal sungin tawlet tunga a tuong Eutychus kici tangval pa khat a kimut suohin a lusu hi. A kimut nahsuo seng ahi ziehin dawl thumna panin kiesuhin a sisa-in a luong kiphong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle Paul kumsuh pai a, ama tungah bawhsuhin a kawipom a, “Patau sih un, azieh pen ama sungah a hinna om lai hi,” ci-in kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin innkhan tungnung ah Paul kato a, ama in khomun balnenin ne a, amate tawh khuovah dongin a holim zaw ciengin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua sung tengin amate in tangval pa a hingin a zawpi vua, a kipah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kote in Paul ka lah sawm ziehun Assos khuo ah tembaw tawh ka na mapei uhi; azieh pen Paul in leilam tawh pei ding a gelsa mal ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Assos khuo ah ei mu ciengin kohawn zong ama tembaw tungah tuongsahin Mitylene khuo ah ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua panin tembaw tawh ka dingkhie vua, a zing ciengin Chios tuikul tawh a kigalsaina mun ka tung uhi. A zing ni-in Samos tuikul ka tung vua, a thai ni-in Miletus khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen Paul in Asia gam sungah a hun zang loin Ephesus khuo nawtsuoh dinga a khensatsa ahi hi; ahi theile Pentcost pawi ni-in Jerusalem-ah a om nuom mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in Melitus khuo panin Ephesus khuo ah mi sawl a, pawlpi upate in ama a kimupi nadingun a thuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama kung a tun ciengun amate kungah, “Asia gam kang tun masah ni-a kipanin note lahah ka op sunga ka hindan zosie na thei sieng ta vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jew mite in ei na tha sawmna zieh vua ang tung gimnate keima in ka na thuoh a, kiniemkhiehna le hlitui naptui tawh Topa’ na ka na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in na phattuom nading uh thute khat zong hen nei loin mipi mai-ah ahi a, inn khat zaw inn khatah ahi zongin hing genin kang hil zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima in Jew mite le Greek-te tungah Pasien lama kisiakiana thu le Topa Jesu lama upna thute teci ka pan zo lam noma ma in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in Hlagau’ sila ka hi ma bangin, kei tungah bang hing pieng ding ci thei lopi-in Jerusalem khuo-a pei ding ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale khuopi zosie-ah thongkiehna le bawlsietnate in ei ngah gige a hina thu Hlagau Siengtho in kei tungah teci a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien’ hepina ziehin Topa Jesu kung pana ka nga lungdamna thu ka teci pan nading ahi ka lampi le ka nasepnate ka zaw thei nading ahi nah po leh kei adingin ka hinna man nei-in ka ngaisun sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Tu-in ahile note lahah hing vah kawikawi-in Pasien’ gam thu kang hil ahi note koima khat beh in ka mai nei mu ngai nawn sih ding uhi, ci ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahi tah ziehin tuni-in note khatpo’ sisan ziehin maw ka puo sih hi, ci thu kang gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien’ gelna buppi ip nei loin note tungah teci ka pang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien in a Tapa’ sisan tawh a leisa ama’ hlattuom pawlpi a vah dingin, Hla Siengtho in note’ khut sunga ang koi na tuuhon zosie ule noma ma limtahin na kem un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka pei zaw ciengin note lahah ngie gilote hing lutin tuuhonte ang dawm vawt sih ding uhi, ci ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Noma’ pawl sung pan nangawnin zong mi kimkhat in amate lamah nuazuite a zawl nadingun thuman a lehei mi ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin kigalging unlen, kum thum sung a sun a zanin khawl loin hlitui luong kawmin mi zosie tunga kang thuhilte na phawh bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tu-in Pasien in note hing lamkipin a siensuosa mi zosie lahah gouluo ang pie ama’ hepina thu sungah note kang ap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koima’ neisa, ngun ahi a, kham ahi a, puonsil nihten ahi zongin ka deigaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka khut tawh na ka sem a, keima le ka guolte’ kisapnate ka sihna thu noma ma in na thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />‘Ngana sangin piehna-ah thupha tamzaw hi,’ ci Topa Jesu’ thugente phawhin tam bang nasep hakatna tawh a thanemte i hu ding uhi, ci-in na kung vuah gamtat zie ding kang lah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in thu a gen zaw ciengin khupdinin amate zosie tawh thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate zosie nahpi-in kapin Paul kawi-in a nam vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a diehdiehin amate in ei mu nawn lo ding uhi, a ci ziehin a da mama uhi. Tua ciengin amate in tembaw tung dong ama a hla uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate tawh ka kikhen zaw ciengun tembaw tawh Cos tuikul ah tangtahin ka pei vua, a zing ni-in Rodes tuikul tungin tua panin Patara khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phoenicia gam zuon ding tembaw khat ka mu ziehun tua tembaw tuongin ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cyprus tuikul ka mu ciengun a veilamah ka pei vua, Syria gam galkai-in Tyre khuo ka tun ciengun tembaw in a vante suo ding ahi ziehin tua munah ka kum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua munah nuazuite ka mu vua, ni sagi sung ka tam uhi. Jerusalem ah Paul a peisuoh lo nadingin Hlagau Siengtho tungtawnin amate in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khum munah ka nite uh a tawp ciengin ding dawhin ka khuolzinna uh ka zom uhi; tuale amate in a unpi-un a zi a tate utawh khuo pulamah ei hla uhi. Kohaw zong tua mun tuipieu ah khupdingin thu ka ngen vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khatlekhat mangpha ka kipai uhi. Tua ciengin tembaw tungah ka tuong vua, amate inn lamah a kilekia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tyre khuo panin tuipi tung khuolzin a tawp ciengin Ptolemais khuopi ka tung uhi; tua munah thu um mite hopi-in amate tawh ni khat ka omton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zing ciengin pei-in Caesarea khuo ka tung uhi; tuale upa sagite lahah khat ahi lungdamna thugen pa Philip inn ah ka tam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in pasal nei nai lo kamsang letsong a nga tanu li a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua munah ni tampi ka tam sungun Judah gam panin Agabus min nei kamsang khat ang peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kote kungah ama hing pei a, Paul’ kawnggah la-in tua tawh a khut le a kengte a khi zaw ciengin, “Hlagau Siengtho in, ‘Jew mite in Jerusalem khuo ah tami kawnggah nei pa tam bangin khi-in Gentile-te khut sungah pie ding uhi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tami thu ka zah ciengun kote le tua sunga om mite in Jerusalem ah Paul a peito lo nadingin ka hlo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Paul in, “Bang dingin note tam bangin kapin ka lungsim kitapkhap nadingin gamta na hi uh ahei? Bangzieh ahei cile hencipna hi khop loin Topa Jesu’ min adingin Jerusalem ah sina nangawn a thuoh dinga a kithawisa ka hi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama a kizawl zawh lo ciengin, “ Topa’ deina bang hi taheh!” ci simlo ka dai khawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua nite zaw ciengin kithawi-in Jerusalem khuo ah ka peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Caesarea khuo panin zong nuazui pawlkhat in ei zui vua, ka zintun nading uh nuazui masa khat ahi Cyprus-te Mnason inn dongah ei hla uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem khuo ka tun ciengun sanggamte in lungdam tahin ei na dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zing ciengin James kungah Paul tawh ka va haw ta vua, upate zosie zong a na om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Paul in amate a hopi zaw ciengin a nasepna tungtawnin Gentile-te lahah Pasien’ nasepnate khat zaw khat a bansut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in tua thu a zah ciengun Pasien a phat uhi. Tua ciengin amate in, “Sanggam pa aw, Jew mite lahah thu um mi tul bangza om zo ci na thei a, a unpi-un thukham zui ding lam a pawnthaw mamate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gentile-te lahah a teng Jew mite zosie in Moses’ thukham a taisan nading ule a tate uzong a tep uh kitan loin a ngainate uh a zui lo nadingun genin na hil lam amate kungah kigen zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in tam sunga nang tun lam za valon ding uh ahi ciengin bang law ding i hi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n kang gen bangun bawl in. Kote in a kiciemsa mi li ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuate tawh kipawl inlen ngaina kisiensuona ah amate tawh va kihalin a lu a heukieu man ding uzong sum va pie ta’n. Tua bangin bawl lacin mi zosie in nang tungtang a gensa thu uh bangma ahi lo lam le nang mama zong thukham zui na hi lam ang thei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin Gentile thu um mite ading ahile milim biehna ante, sasi, lawlmeh sate le numei-pasal pahtatnate a tan nading uh, ka thukhensatna uh lai ka hlah zo uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Paul in tua mite zawpi a, a zing ni-in amate tawh amama a kisiensuo zaw-in biehinnpi sungah lut a, siensuona ni a tawp hun ding le amate ciet in biehpiehna a bawl ding uh hunte a va theisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sagi a cin kuon ciengin Asia gam pana Jew mite in biehinnpi sungah ama a mu ciengun mihonte hantawhin a man vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Israel mite aw, ei panpi un! I mite, i thu kham le tami mun langpangin muncin tenga om mi zosie tungah thu hil kawikawi pa tam pa ahi hi; tua banah ama in Gentile-te peipi-in biehinnpi sungah lutsah a, tami mun siengtho a buasah hi,” ci-in a awng vapuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen masanglai khatin khuo sungah ama le Ephesus khuomi Trophimus a kithuo a mu vua, tuaci’n biehinnpi sungah Paul in ama ang lutpi hi ngelngel va, ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin khuozang buppi buoi a, mite zong a hontai uhi. Amate in Paul a man vua, biehinnpi sung panin ama kaiphitin thakhatin kotpite a kha pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate in Paul tha a sawm laitahun Jerusalem khuopi buppi buoi hi, ci-in galkapmangpa kungah thu na kipuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in thakhatin galkapte le galkap bute hlanin amate lamah a taisuh pai uhi. Amate in galkapmangpa le galkapte a mu ciengun Paul a vuo nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapmangpa zong pei a, ama manin siakhau ni tawh khi dingin thu a pie hi; ama koi hi a, bang sem ahei ci thu ama in dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mihonpi lahah pawlkhat in thu khat gen a, adang pawlkhat in thudang khat ma genin a awng gawp uhi; mihonte buoi mama a, ama in lah a thu a theicien lo ziehin galkap len sungah Paul a peipi nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kenlei cielah Paul a tun ciengin mihonte gilo seng ahi ziehin galkapte in ama a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A zui mihonpi in “Ama that un!” ci-in a awng vapo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Galkap len sungah Paul a lutpi kuonun ama in galkapmangpa kungah, “Thu khat kang gen thei diei mah?” ci-in dong hi. Galkapmangpa in, “Greek ham na thei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tua ciengin masang lai khat a kumpi ledo dinga mi holtuo, senel gama misuom tul li a peipi Egypt mipa hi lo na mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Paul in, “Khuopi thupi mama khat ahi Cilicia gam Tarsus khuopi-a pieng Judah mi khat ka hi hi; hepina tawh mipite kungah thu ei gensah in,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ama in phalna a pieh ciengin Paul zong kenlei ciel tungah dingin mipite a dai thei nadingin a khut zah phei-in a sip bepun Hebrew kam tawh thu gen a:
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sanggamte le pate aw, tu-in na mai vuah ka kihutna dinga kang gen thu ngai un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Hebrew hama a thugen a zah ciengun a sip tasem vua, tua ciengin Paul in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Kei pen Cilicia gam Tarsus khuopi-a suoh Judah mi khat ka hi a, ahi vangin tami khuo sunga Gamaliel’ kengbula a khang ka hi a, i pu i pate’ thukhamte khautahin ei na kihil a, tu ni-a no teng zosie ma bangin Pasien lamah ka na pawnthaw mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in tami Lampi a zui numei pasal a koimapo manin thong sung denna-in ka nei a, a si dongun ka bawlsie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Siempu lien pa le upa buppi in zong kei thu teci a pang thei ding uhi. Damascus khuopi-a sanggamte a kihen nadingin keima in amate tung panin phalna laite ka na nga a, tuaci’n amate dan a kipieh thei nadingin khau tawh a hen ding le Jerusalem khuopi ah a puohkia dingin tua tahah ka va kuon ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka khuolzinna lampi ah Damascus khuo ka tun kuon sunkim pawl laitahin, vantung panin khuovah golpi khat in thakhatin ei khawsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuolah ka pua a, tuale aw khat in keima kungah, ‘Saul, Saul aw, bang dinga kei nei ci bawlsiet ahei?’ ei ci ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in, ‘ Topa aw nang koi na hei?’ ci-in ka dong leh ama in keima kungah, ‘Na bawlsiet Nazareth khuomi Jesu ka hi hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua laitahin ka zawpi mite in tua khuovah a mu vangun kei kunga thu ei gen pa’ aw a za sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in, ‘Bang ka bawl diei Topa ?’ ci-in ka dong hi. Topa in keima kungah, ‘Tho inlen Damascus khuo ah pei-in, tuanah Pasien in sep dinga a sesa thu zosie ang kigen ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua khuovah’ vang tang luo ahi ziehin khuo ka mu thei ta sih a, ka zawpite in ka khutin ei kai vua, Damascus khuo lamah ei peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Thukham tawh kituoha biehna pawnthaw mama le Jew mite zosie in a na genphat uh Ananias kici mi khat tua tahah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale ama hing pei-in ka gei-ah ang ding a, “Sanggam pa Saul aw, khuo mukia in!’ ei ci hi. Tua hun lienin ka mit ang vah a, ama ka mu thei pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “I pu i pate’ Pasien in ama’ deina a thei ding, Midih Pa a mu ding le ama’ aw a za dingin nang ang teel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile na musa le na zahsa thute, mi zosie tunga teci a pang ding na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in zong bang dinga kiheh na hei? Tho-in ki-baptize inlen, ama’ min lo inlen na mawnate sawp siengsah in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Jerusalem ah ka kilekia zaw biehinnpi sungah thu ka nget laitahin mumang bangin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in Jesu ka mu a, tuale ama in, ‘Kinaw inlen Jerusalem panin peikhie meng in, azieh pen amate in keima thu na teci panna ang sang sih ding uhi,’ ci-in ei gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima in, “ Topa aw, kikhopna inn cintengah nang ang um mite thongkhie-in, ka sat lam amate mama in ei thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma’ teci pa Stephen’ sisan a luon laitahin kei mama zong ama gei-ah ka ding a, ama a si ding thukimin a thatte’ puon ka keppieh lai hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in keima kungah, “A gamlapi khata a om Gentile-te kungah hing sawl ding ka hi ziehin pei in,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tam thu a gen dong cieng amate in a thugen uh a ngai lai vua, ahi vangin amate in, “Tam bang mihing leitung panin hemkhie un! Azieh pen ama a hing dingin a kilawm sih hi,” ci-in a kiko vapual uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate a kiko kawmun a puontuolte uh suo dawhin van lamah leivuite a the laitahun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />amate in Paul a hici awhsanna uh azieh bang pen ahei ci a thei nadingin galkapmangpa in satna tawh ama thusit dingin galkap lenah a peipi nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin savun khauhuol tawh ama a khi ciengun Paul in a gei-a ding galkap bupa kungah, “Khiel hi, ci-a thu kikhen lopi-in Rome mi khat na sat ding uh thukham tawh kituoh ma amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Galkap bupa in tua thu a zah bepin galkapmangpa kungah pei-in, “Nang bang sem ding na hei? Tam mipa, Rome gammi ahi bo hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Galkapmangpa pei-in Paul kungah, “Nang Rome gammi na hi amah? ei gen in,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Ka hi ma hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Galkapmangpa in, “Rome gammi ka nga nadingin sum tampitah ka tawp hi,” ci-in a dawng hi. Paul in, “Kei ka suo-a kipanin Rome gammi-a pieng ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thakhatthu-in ama kung panin thu sit dinga a kisa mite a kilekia pai uhi; tuale galkapmangpa in siakhau tawh a khi Paul pen Rome gammi khat ahi lam thei ahi ziehin a zau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bang zieha Jew mite in Paul a mawmat uh ahei ci thu galkapmang pa in a thei nop ziehin a zing ni-in ama hlansah a, a kimutuo dingin siempu uhpite le biehna uliente zosie thu a pie hi. Ama in Paul peipisuhin a mai vuah a dingsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul in biehna uliente a etcien laitahin ama in, “Sanggamte aw, keima in tuni cieng dongin Pasien mai-ah lungsim kisuonna om loin hinkhuo ka na mang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin siempu lien pa Ananias in a gei-a ding mite kungah Paul’ nephu behpieh un ci-in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Paul in ama kungah, “A kizutngo kawm aw, Pasien in nang ang beng ding hi! Kei tungah thukham tawh a kituoha thukhen dingin tua sunga to hi napi cin, bang dinga a lelama thu na khen a, kei nephu beh dinga thu na pieh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A gei-a a ding mite in, “Nang, Pasien’ siempu lien pa zako viel ding na mah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Paul in, “Sanggamte aw, ama siempu lien pa ahi lam ka thei sih hi; azieh pen, ‘Na mite uh’ makai pa na gensie sih ding uhi,’ ci-in kigiel ma hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi pawlkhatte pen Sadducees-te hi a, adangte Pharisees-te ahi lam Paul in a thei bepin ama in, “Sanggamte aw, kei zong Pharisees-te’ tapa, Pharisee mi khat ma ka hi hi. Misite thawkia tawh kisai lametna thu ziehin thusitna thuoh ka hi hi,” ci-in biehna uliente mai-ah a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in tua thu a gen ciengin Sadducees-te le Pharisee-te kikalah kiselna pieng a, tua a kikhawm mite phalni a kisuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(Sadducees-te in misite thawkiana om lo a, vantung mite hile, hlagau kicite hile om lo hi, a ci uhi; hizongle Pharisee-te in tua thu thumte om hi, ci-in pom uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin buoina lienpi tung a, Pharisee pawlte lah panin thukham hil siete pawlkhat dingin nahpi tahin a niel vua, “Tam pa tungah bangma mawna ka mu sih uhi. Hlagau ahiei vantungmi ahiei khat in ama kunga thu a gen hi kha mawh leh bang na law ta ding vuoi?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kiselna a husiet mama ciengin amate in Paul hing ehmal kha va uh ci-in galkapmangpa a lunghimaw ziehin, galkapte peisuhin zawthawthu tawh ama la-in galkap len-ah a peipi nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum zanin Paul kungah Topa ding a, “Kilungkhausah in! Bangzieh ahei cile Jerusalem khuo ah keima’ thu teci na pan bangin Rome khuopi ah zong teci na pang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin Jew mite in kidap zopna khat bawlin Paul a tha masangsie uh an ne lo tui dawn loin a op nadingun kiciemna a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami sawmdapna sunga a kihal mi sawm li val bang a hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siempu uhpi pa le upate kungah amate pei-in, “Paul ka tha masangsie-un bangma an ciem lo dingin khautahin ka kiciem zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin tu-in note le na biehna uliente in Paul’ thu a kicien zaw-a thu sit nuom kinei unlen, galkapmang pa in na kung vua ama ang peipisuh nadingin theisah un. Ama ang tun masangin a that dingin a kiging sa-in ka om uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua laitahin Paul sanggamnu’ tapa in a kibuhdapna thu a zah ciengin galkap len sungah lutin Paul kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Paul in galkap bute khat hlan a, “Tami tangval pa in galkapmangpa kungah gen ding thu kimkhat nei ahi ziehin ama kungah va zawpi ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkap bupa in galkapmangpa kungah tua tangval pa zawpi a, “Thongkie pa Paul in keima ei hlansah a, tami tangval pa in nang tungah gen ding thu nei ahi ziehin ama na kunga ang puoh dingin kei ei sawl hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Galkapmangpa in tua pa a khut tawh kai-in ama ni guoh a peikhie vua, “Nei gen ding thu bang ahei,” ci-in a dongdap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in, “Jew mite in Paul’ thu a kicing zaw-a a thei nuom kipangin zing ciengin biehna uliente mai-ah Paul na peipi nadingin ang nget ding uh kithukim zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin amau’ thu mang sin, azieh pen ama buhdap dingin mihing sawmli val bang a om uhi. Amate in ama a tha masangsie uh an ne lo tui dawn lo dingin kiciemna a nei uhi. Tu-in amate in nangma kung panin kamciem beh ngahin kiging sa-in a om uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkapmangpa in tangval pa kungah, “Keima kungah tami thu nei ko lam koima tungah gen sin,” ci-in vaihlahin a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in galkap bute ni hlan a, “Tu zan nai kuo-in Caesarea khuo-a pei dingin galkap za ni, sakol galkap sawm sagi le teipi tawi galkap za ni tawh a baisa-in om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Paul’ tuon nading sakolte zong pie unlen, uhpi pa Felix kungah hoitahin peipi un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in tam bangin laihlah khat giel hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Keima Claudius Lysias in a Lien uhpi pa Felix kang hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jew mite in tampa a that dihtah vua, ahi vangin ama Rome mi khat ahi lam ka thei bepin ka galkapte tawh pei-in ama ka va hun dawh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama a mawsahna thu uh thei nuom ka hi ziehin keima in a biehna uliente uh mai-ah ka peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama pen amau’ thukham tungtanga kimawsah na hi lel a, thong khieh nadingin ahi a, tha nadingin ahi zongin a kilawm khielna ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tam pa tha kisawm hi, ci thu ka thei ciengin na kungah ama thakhatthu-in kang peisah a, a mawmat mite in a mawsahna thu uh na kunga ang sun nadingun thu ka pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuaci’n galkapte in a kisawlna bangin Paul la-in Antipatris khuo ah a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A zing ciengin sakol galkapte tawh ama peisuohsah a, amate ahile galkap lenah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Caesaria khuo a tun ciengun uhpi pa kungah a lai puoh a pie vua, Paul zong ama tungah a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in tua laihlah sim a, nang bang gam pan na hei, ci-in dong a, ama in Cilicia gammi ahi lam a thei ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ama in, “Ang mawmat mite ang tun ciengin na thu kang sit ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Herod kumpi inn sungah ama koi-in a cin nadingun thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw ni nga ciengin upa pawl khat le Tertullus a kici sitni khat tawh siempu lien pa Ananias a peisuh vua, amate in uhpi pa mai-ah Paul a mawsahna uh thute a sung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paul a kihlat zaw ciengin Tertullas in ama mawsahna thugen a kipan hi: “A Lien Mangpipa aw, nangma ziehin lungmuong tahin sawtpitah ka om vua, nangma’ vaihawm siemna tawh tami minamte adingin puophatnate zong kibawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote in mun zosie le vai zosie-ah tam na vaihawmnate lungdamna lienpi tawh ka sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin kote in sawtveipi kang buoisah nuom lo ziehun tomkima kang gen ding thute hepina tawh nei ngaipieh nadingin kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote in tam mipa pen buoina a piengsah pa ahi a, leitung bup Jew mite lahah mi holtuo pa khat le Nazareth pawlte’ makai pa khat ahi lam ka thei zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in biehinnpi nangawn buasah a sawm ziehin kote in ama ka man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kote in ka thukham utawh kituohin ama tungah thu ka khen sawm uhi. Hizongle galkapmangpa Lysias hing pei-in ko kung panin pauhat thu tawh ama ei lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang mama in thu hing sit lacin ama tunga ka mawmatna zosie uh a man ahi lam na thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jew mite in zong ama panpi-in tami a thugente zosie a man ma ahi hi, a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uhpi pa in thu gen dingin Paul lamah khut a van ciengin ama in, “Nangma in tam minam tungah kum tampi sung thukhenpa na hi lam ka thei ziehin lungdam tahin ka kisutna ding thu ang gen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na mu thei ding ma bangin Jerusalem ah Pasien bie dinga ka peito zaw ni sawm le ni ni zong a val nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in biehinnpi sungah mi khatpo tawh ka kiselna hile, kikhopna inn sung ah hile, khuopi sung muncin tengah hile mihonpi ka holtuona bangma a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-a amate in ang sun uh ei mawmatna thu uzong a manna thu ang lah thei tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongle keima in pawltuom a ci uh tami Lampi zui-in ka pu ka pate’ Pasien ka bie a, thukham laibu sung le kamsangte’ laibu sunga a kigielsa thu zosie ka um hi, ci thu na kungah kang pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate mama in zong midihte le midih lote’ thawkiana om tuoh ding hi, ci-in a san bangun keima in Pasien sungah lametna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin keima in Pasien tung le mi zosie tungah kisuonna ka nei lo nadingin ka hi thei za tawh ka hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum tampi zaw ciengin ka minamte kungah huna sum puoh ding le biehna lui dingin tu-a ang kuon ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in biehinnpi sungah tamte bawlin ka op ei mu lai-un mihonpi om lo, buoina zong om vawt loin kisiensuona ziatan ka man zo lien leh amate in kei ei na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle Asia gam pana ang pei Jew mite pawlkhat zong a om vua, amate in kei tungah mawsah ding thu khatpo ei nei uleh hing pei-in na mai-ah ei mawmatna uh thu ang sun ding uh a kilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi sihle zong biehna uliente mai-a ka din lai-in tam mite in keima tungah bang khielna mu uh ahei ci gensah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />amate mai-a ka din lai-in, ‘Misite thawkiana thu tawh kisai-in tuni-in na mai vuah thusitna ka thuoh hi,’ ci-a ka kiko pen ahi lo buong leh bangma om lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanle Lampi thu a theizaw Felix in a thu khen ding sot to a, “Galkapmangpa Lysias ang tun ciengin keima in na thu uh kang khenpieh ding hi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkap bupa in ama a cin nadingin thu pie a, hinanle ama in phabep cieng khat suotahna a pieh nading le a kisapnate a en nuom a lawmte khatpo a kham lo nadingin zong thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni bangza ahei khat a sawt zaw ciengin Felix in Judah numei khat ahi, a zi Drusilla tawh pei-in Paul hlansah a, Jesu Khris upna thu a gen a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Paul in dihna thu, pumpi kidehzawhna thu le ang tung ding thukhenna thute a kuppi ciengin Felix zau a, “Tu-in pei phot inlen hun lem ka nga ciengin kang hlansah kia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khum hun ma-in Paul in sum ei pie kha leh ci lametna tawh ama hlan thimthemin hopi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kum ni a cin zaw ciengin Felix’ za laihin Porcius Festus pang a, Felix in Judah-te’ maipha a mu nop ziehin thong kiasa-in Paul a nuasie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua gam a tunzaw ni thum ciengin Caesarea khuo panin Jerusalem ah Festus peito a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua munah siempu uhpite le Judah makaite in Paul a mawmatna thu uh ama kungah na sung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a angvanna-in Jerusalem ah Paul a puoh nadingin Festus kungah ngenin a thum uhi. A tahtahin amate in lamkalah ama a tha sawm uh ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Festus in zong, Caesarea ah Paul kikhum a, kei mama zong tua munah a sawt loin pei ka sawm hi, ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in, “Na thunei uliente utawh ei peisuhsah unlen tampa tawh kisai-in khielna khatpo a op leh kimawmat ta uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate lahah ni giet ahiei ni sawm ahiei sanga a tamzaw lo khat a tam zaw ciengin Caesarea khuo-ah a peisuh hi; a zing ni ciengin thukhenna topha tungah to a, ama in Paul a kipeipi nadingin thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Paul a tun ciengin Jerusalem pana a peisuh Jew mite in a imtawm pai vua, amate in teci tawh a lah thei lo uh mawsietna thulien tampite tawh ama a mawmat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paul in a kisutna ah, “Jew mite’ thukham tungah hile, biehinnpi tungah hile, kumpipa tungah hile bangma khielna ka bawl sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Festus in Jew mite’ maipha a nga nuom ziehin Paul kungah, “Tami thu tawh kisai-in keima mai-ah thusit dingin Jerusalem ah nang peito nuom ei mah?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Paul in, “Kumpipa’ thukhenna topha mai-a a ding ka hi hi; tam mun pen thu ei kisit nadinga a kilawm mun ahi hi. Nang in nei thei siem ma bangin Jew mite tungah khielna bangma ka bawl sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in kei ka khiel khah a, si nading lawm bawlkhiel ka nei leh, sina tawh kipel thei nadingin ka hanciem sih ding hi; ahi vangin ei mawmatna uh a dih lopi ahile koima in amau’ khut sungah ei ap thei tuon sih ding hi. Kumpipa kungah ka thu ka khang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama’ upa vaihawmte tawh a kikup zaw ciengin Festus in, “Kumpipa kungah na thu na khang zo hi; kumpipa kungah na pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni tampi zaw ciengin Festus dawn dingin Caesarea khuo-ah Kumpi Agrippa le Bernice a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khuo-ah ni tampi a taam zaw ciengun Festus in kumpipa mai-ah Paul’ thu sung a, “Felix in thong sunga a tapnuasie mi khat tanah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem-a ka om lai-in siempu uhpite le Judah upate in kei kungah ama’ thu ei ko vua, a thu ei khenpieh in, ci-in ang thum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in amate kungah, “Mawsahna a thuohte in a mawsahte tawh kimaituo-in a kimawsahna thu a phel thei nadingin hun lemtang khat a nga masangsie, a mawsahte’ khut sungah mi khatpo ap ding pen Rome ngaina hi lo hi, ci-in amate kungah ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n tam munah amate kimu-in a zing ciengin thukhenna topha tungah to pai-in, tua mipa ang kipeipi nadingin thu ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A mawsahte ang din ciengun ka upmaw bang loin mawmatna bangma a gen tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kithutu pen uh ahile a biehna vai ule a sisa kimlai Paul in hingkia ta, a ci Jesu’ tungtang guol bep no khat na hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami dawhnate bangci kantel ding ci thei lo ka hi ziehin Jerusalem ah pei-in tua tahah thusit ding na nuom eimah, ci-in ama ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Paul in a Vanglien Kumpipa khen dingin thu khang zo ta ahi ziehin, ama kumpipa kunga ka puoh zo masangsie thong sunga khum phot dingin thu ka pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Agrippa in Festus kungah, “Kei mama in tami pa thu ka za nuom hi,” a ci ciengin, “Zing ciengin ama’ thu na za ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n a zing ciengin Agrippa le Bernice-te thupitah le kiliensah tahin ang pei vua, kumpi galkapmangte le khuo sunga mi thupite tawh mipi kikhopna inn sungah ang lut uhi. Tua ciengin Festus in thu pie a, Paul kilutpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale Festus in, “Kumpi Agrippa le kote tawh tana om mi zosie aw, Jerusalem khuo sung le tami khuo sungah a sawt hin dingin kilawm lo hi, ci-in Judah mi zosiete awngin kei kunga ang nget uh ahi tam mipa note in na mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi vangin a sina za va-ia dingin ke’n a gamtat khielna bangma ka mu sih hi; ama in a Vanglien Kumpipa tungah a thu khang zo ta ahi ziehin ama peisah dingin ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin thunei pen pa tungah ama’ thu ka giel ding a kicien bangma ka nei sih hi. Tua ahi ziehin na mai vuah ama kang puoh a, ama thu i sit zaw ciengin giel ding thu pawlkhat nei kha leng cina tawh, adiehdiehin nang Kumpi Agrippa kunga kang puoh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen a kimawsahna thu bang teng ahei, ci gen lopi-in thongkie mi khat mawh hla ding ci pen kei adingin a thu kicingtah ka sa zo sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Agrippa in Paul kungah, “Na thu na gen thei nading phalna kang pie hi,” ci-in a gen ciengin Paul in a khut zahin a kisutna ding thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kumpi Agrippa aw, tuni-in ahile na mai-ah Jew mite’ ei mawsahna thu zosie ka kisutna ding thu gen ding ka hi tah ziehin hampha ka kisa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma in Jew mite’ ngaina zosie le a kikalna uh thu zosie na theicien deudeu hi. Tua ahi ziehin ka thugente lungduoi taha nei ngaipieh nadingin kang thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“A cila patin Jerusalem khuo ka mipite lahah hinkhuo ka na zang a, ka khangno lai-a kipanin Jew mite zosie in keima’ hindan ei na theisiem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka biehna sung vuah a khau penpen ahi Pharisee pawl ka hi lam le ka hindante teci a pan nuom uleh a sawtpi lai-a kipanin a theisa uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in ka pu ka pate uh a na pieh kamciem ka lamet ziehin tu-in tam munah thusitna thuoha a ding ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minam sawm le nite in tuami kamciem nga dinga a kilamet ziehun sun le zanin kukal tahin Pasien a na bie mielmuol uhi. A Lien Mangpipa aw, tami lametna thu zieha Jew mite in kei ei mawmat uh ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Note khatpo in Pasien in misite thosah hi, ci thu bang dinga uphuoi lo-a na ngaisut uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Kei mama in Nazareth mi Jesu’ min langpanga na tampi sep ding kilawm hi, ci-in ka na ngaisun ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in tua bangin Jerusalem ah ka na sem pai hi; siempu uhpite’ phalna tawh misiengtho tampi tahte thong sungah ka khum banah amate si nading thu a kikhen ciengin zong thukimna me ka na pie lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zawthaw thu tawh Pasien a gensiet nadingun kikhopna inn zosie-ah amate tamveipi dan ka pie hi; amate tungah lungthah luo ka hi ziehin gamdang khuopite lah nangawnah amate ka sulzui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tam thu lungsimah kuo kawmin siempu uhpite’ thuneina le sawlna tawh Damascus ah ka va zin ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a Lien Mangpipa aw, sunkim pawl lampi-a ka pei laitahin keima le ka zawpite kimvelah ni sanga a tangzaw khuovah khat vantung panin ang tang ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unpi-un lei lahah ka puasuh ciengun Hebrew ham tawh, ‘Saul, Saul aw, bang dinga nei bawlsiet ahei? Keng tawh ciengzum khat sui lacin nangma kiliemsuo na hi lel hi,’ ei ci aw khat ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />‘ Topa aw, nang koi na hei?’ ci-a ka dawh ciengin Topa in, ‘Na bawlsiet pa Jesu ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin tho inlen na keng tawh ding in; bangzieh ahei cile nang in keima sunga na musa nate le na tunga keima kang kilah lai nading thute a sem ding le teci a pang dinga kang se zieha na kunga ang kilah ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate kunga kang sawl nading ahi na mite le Gentile-te’ khut sung panin nangma kang hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuomiel sung panin khuovah sung le Satan’ vanglietna panin Pasien lamah Gentile-te a kihei ziehun a mawnate uh a kimaisah thei nading le, keima sunga om a upna ziehun amate in a kisiensuosa mite lahah mun a nga thei nadingun, a mit uh a honpieh dingin nangma kang sawl ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tua zaw ciengin Kumpi Agrippa aw, vantung mangmuna thu mang loin ka om sih a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ahi vangin amate kisiakia-in Pasien lam ang kihei nading ule kisiakiana tawh a kituoh gamtatnate ang lah nadingun, a masa penin Damascus khuo, tua zaw ciengin Jerusalem khuo, Judea gam teng le Gentile-te kungah zong ka tangko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tami thu hang tawh Jew mite in biehinnpi sungah kei ei manin ei tha sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in Pasien kung panin huna ka nga a, tuni cieng dongin tam munah dingin, a neu a lien tungah teci ka pang a, bangma dang gen loin Moses le kamsangte in ang pieng ding hi, ci-a a gensa uh thu ma ka gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua thu in: Messiah in sina thuohin misite lah panin a tho masa pen hi ding a, i mipite kung le Gentile-te kungah khuovah thu a tangko ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in tami a kisutna thu a gen laitahin Festus in, “Paul aw, nang mimaw na hi hi! Na pilna tampi sinna in nang ang lemotsah ta hi!” ci-in nahpitahin ama a kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hizongle Paul in, “Hoi tungtuong Festus aw, kei pen a maw ka hi malmal sih a, pilvang taha thuman thutah gen ka hizaw bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kumpipa in tami thute na thei tahtah ziehin nop bangbangin kang gen ahi hi; azieh pen tami thute khat mama zong a kidapbawl hi valawh lo ahi ziehin na thei khah lo om lo dingin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kumpi Agrippa aw, kamsangte na um ei mah? Na up lam ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Agrippa in Paul kungah, “Hun tomno khat sungin Tapidaw suoh dinga ei zawl na hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Paul in, “Hun a tom a, a sau zongin nang beh hi loin tuni-a ka thugen a ngai mi zosiete in tami siakol bulnate ci longal ah kei ei bah kim nading vua Pasien kunga thu ngen ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpipa le uhpi pa a dingto vua, tuale Bernice le a topi mite zong a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate a peikhiet zaw ciengun, “Tam pa in si nading le thongkieh nading za-in bangma bawl lo hi,” khatlekhat a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Agrippa in Festus kungah, “Tam pa in kumpipa tungah a thu a na khang zo nai lo khat hi leh kihla thei lel ma hiven,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Italy gamah tembaw tawh ka pei ding uh thu a kikhensat zaw ciengin amate in Augustus galkap honte lahah zakhat a uh Julius kici galkap bupa’ khut sungah Paul le thongkie dang pawlkhatte a ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asia gam tuipi dung teng pei dinga a kisa Adramyttium tembaw tungah tuongin tuipi tungah ka om vua, Thessalonica pana ang pei Macedonia mi khat ahi Aristarchus in zong ko ei zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zing ciengin Sidon khuo ah ka tung uhi; Julius in Paul na limbawl mama a, ama’ tasapnate a et thei nadingun a lawmte kungah ama a hawsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua khuo panin tuipi tungah ka peikia vua, hui ang lelan ziehin Cyprus tuikul kiliesahin ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cilicia le Pamphylia gam gala om tuipi ka kantan zaw ciengun Lycia gama om Mura khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua munah zakhat a uh galkap bupa in Italy lam zuon ding Alexandra tembaw khat mu a, tua tungah ei tuongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A muon muon no-in ni tampi sung ka pei vua, hamsapi-in Cnidus khuo ka pautun uhi. Tuale hui ang lelan ziehin Crete tuikul ka kiliesah vua, Salmone galah ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hamsapi-in tuipi gei zui-in ka pei vua, Lasea khuopi gei Khawlmun Nuom kici mun ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Antan hun a tawp zo zieh le tuipi tung khuolzinna a zauhuoi ziehin Paul in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Siete aw, i tuipi khuolzinna-ah tuohsie-in supna tampi om ding a, tembaw le i van puohte uh i sup ban vuah i hinna uh i tanlaw ding uh zauhuoi hi, ci ka mu thei hi,” ci-in amate tungah ngaisutna a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin galkap bupa in Paul’ thugen sangin tembaw uhpa le tembaw nei pa’ thu a mangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Phalbi hun sunga op nadingin tua tembaw khawlna pen mun gina ahi seng lo ziehin tua mun panin Phoenix tembaw khawlna i tun zawh khah uleh tua munah tamin phalbi hun i mang ding uhi, ci-in mi a tamzawte’ deina tawh a pei suoh uhi. Tua mun pen leilu nisuona le leitaw nitumna lam a maingat Crete tuikul tembaw khawlna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leitaw lam hui ang lan hiauhiau ciengin a tupna uh a tung zo-in kingaisut uh ahi ziehin tembaw khina siakawi bot dawhin Crete tuikul pangzui teng nehin khuolzin a kipan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin a sawt loin Crete tuikul lam panin sah-nisuo a kici huipi hat mama khat ang langsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hui in tembaw sem gawpin maiphu zo ta lo ahi ziehin hui lanna lamlamah ka pei mawh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cauda a kici tuikul neu khat in kiliesahin ka tai laitahun tembaw’ gunkuong a siet lo nadingin ka hu zo paupau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in tembaw tungah gunkuong a kaito zaw ciengun tembaw a kip nadingin khauhuol tawh a gah uhi. Syrtis sehtalte a phuh khah ding a zau ziehun siakawi khaisa-in hui in tembaw a tawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huipi in ei nah sem gawp ta ahi ziehin a zing ciengin amate in tembaw vante paimangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a ni thum ni-in tembaw’ vanzahte a khut utawh a paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni tampi sung ni le aasite ang dawh nawn loin huipi ang hat semsem ciengin, kote in suotah nading lametna kici zosie ka nuasie ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sawtveipi an ne loin a op zaw ciengun amate lahah Paul dingin, “Lawmte aw, ka thugen ei mangin Crete tuikul pana a peikhie lo hi poma leih tam sietna le supna tawh i kipel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in kilungkhausah un, azieh pen tembaw khat simlo note lahah mihing a si koima na om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tuzanin keima ei nei le ka bieh Pasien’ vantungmi khat ka gei-ah ang ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Paul aw, zau malmal sin; kumpipa mai-ah na ding valon ding hi; tuale Pasien in tuipi tunga nangma le na zawpite zosie tungah bihna ang pie zo hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n lawmte aw, kilungkhausah un, azieh pen ei kigensa bangin ang pieng tahpi ding hi, ci-in Pasien sungah upna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuikul tung khatah i tung teitei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Huipi in ei mut ziehin Adria tuipi tungah ka lam kawikawi laitah uh a zan sawm le lina zankim pawlin tembaw nasemte in lei tawh i kinai ta hi, ci-in ang ummaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in tuithuhna ang te uleh lam sawm ni bang thuh hi, ci-in ang mu uhi; bano khat zaw ciengin ang tekia uleh lam sawm le lam nga a thuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Suongtum ka phuh khah ding uh ka zau ziehun tembaw nua lamah tembaw khawlsahna siakawi li ka khiesuh vua, zingmawng khuovah nading thu ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hizongle tembaw tung panin tembaw nasemte daptai sawm uh ahi ziehin tembaw khawlsahna siakawi a khiesuh kinei-in tuipi sungah gunkuong a khie dap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuale Paul in mi zakhat uh galkap bupa le galkapte kungah, “Tam mite tembaw sunga a op sih uleh, no zong na suohta zo sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin galkapte in gunkuong khina khauzamte attanin tui sungah a khiesuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khuo vah kuon ciengin Paul in amate zosie an ne dingin sawl a, “Tuni pen patau-in bangma an ne loin na om zaw uh a ni sawm le ni li a cin ni ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin an halkhat ne teitei bo un, kang thum hi, azieh pen tua in note ang hinsuo ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile note khat beh in na samzam khat zong na mansuo sih ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in tam thu a gen zaw ciengin khomun a la hi; tuale mi zosie’ mitmu-in Pasien kungah nuomthu tut a, ama in phalsuo-in a ne dingin a kipan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate zosie zong a lung uh ang nuom a, an a ne ciet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />(Tembaw sunga om mi a unpi-in zani sawm sagi le guh ka pha uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An khamtahin a neh zaw ciengun tembaw a zan nadingin tuipi tungah mangbu vuite a pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin leitung bang mun tung ci a thei sih vangun amate in tuipi pieuzang khat a mu vua, ahi thei leh tua munah tembaw khawlsah dingin a gel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuaci’n tembaw khina siakawipi a khiesuh vua, tuipi sungah tuate a nuasie uhi. Tua hun sung ma-in amate in tembaw hawlna’ a khina khaute a sut dawh vua, huipi in mutin tuipieu lam a pei thei nadingun a mailama tembaw puon a khaisang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuihuol ni in a tetuona muna om sehtal khosang khat a phuh khah ziehin leitungah tembaw a kinga ta hi. Tembaw’ a malam teng tumin a pia thei ta sih a, ahi vangin tuihuol in a nualam a satkeh gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Galkapte’ gelna pen thongkiete khat mama in tui ngapin a suotah lo nadingun amate tha sawm ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hinanle mi zakhat a uh galkap bupa in Paul a suohtahsah nuom ziehin a ngimna bang vua a bawl lo nadingun amate a kham hi. Ama in tuingap theite tui sungah leng masa-in galkai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />tuale a om lai teng singpehte tung po le tembaw van them tung po-ah tuongin a pei nadingun thu a pie hi. Tua bangin leitungah mi zosie galkai-in a suohta kim uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka suotah zaw ciengun tua tuikul pen Malta kici ahi lam ka thei na bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua tuikul mite in lamet lopi-in ka tung vuah migitna ei lah uhi. Guo ang zu-in khuo ang vot pan ta ahi ziehin amate in ka kimkot vuah mei ei tawpiehin ei na zin do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Paul in singkang lomkhat tomin meikuolai-ah a vang leh meisa lah panin gulsum khat hing pusuohin Paul khutah a kiviel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuikul mite in Paul khuta gul kiviel a mu ciengun, “Tam pa pen tuol that khat hi ngelngel ding hi; tuipi tung panin ang suotah vangin a thutang Pasien in a hin ding phal lo hi ding hi,” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Paul in tua gul meikuolai-ah thing dawh a, bangma a ci sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in ama pen hing pawmzahin ahi sihle hing thalpua-in ang si ding hi, ci-in sawtveipitah a khuongai vangun ama tungah thu lamdang a pien lo lam a mu bepun a lungsim uh kikhelin ama pasien khat hi va, a ci ta leuleu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuami mun tawh a kigamla seng lo ah Publius a kici tuikul hausapa’ neisa logamte om a, tuapa in kote ei tungsahin ni thum sung limtahin zin ei do hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Publius’ a pa cithua natna le gilsan vei-in lup mun tung ngahin na om hi. Ama kungah Paul va haw a, ama tungah a khut nga a, thu ngetpiehin a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami thu a pien zaw ciengin tuikul tunga om cina dangte zong hing pei-in damna a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in patawina tampi ei pie vua, ka pei kuon ciengun lamkala zah ding a kisamte zong tembaw tungah ei guonpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hla thum zaw ciengin tua tuikul ah phalbi sunga a na tamsa Unau Kopsuo nite’ lim kisuong Alexandria tembawpi khat zui-in ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sirakus khuo ah ka tung vua, tua munah ni thum sung ka tam uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua ciengin ding leuleu-in Rhegium khuo ka tung uhi. Tua munah ni khat zaw ciengin leitaw lam hui hing langin a ni ni ni-in Puteoli khuo ka tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua munah thu um mite ka mu vua, amate in ni sagi tam dingin ei ciel uhi. Tuaci’n Rome lam zuonin ka pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua Rome-a om thu um mite in ka haw lam a zah ciengun pawlkhatte kei ei dawn dingin Appius Sumbuh le Zinbuh Thum dongah ang pei uhi. Paul in amate a mu ciengin Pasien kungah nuomthu tutin a lung a nuom mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rome khuo ka tun ciengun ama a cing galkap pa tawh a dei bangbanga a op nadingin Paul phalna kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni thum zaw ciengin ama in tuol sung Jew makaite a kikhawmsah hi. Amate a kikhop ciengun ama in amate kungah, “Sanggamte aw, keima in i mipite tungah hile, i pu i pate’ ngaina tungah hile ka sepkhiel bangma om lo napi-in, amate in Jerusalem khuo ah ei manin thong ei khie vua, tua panin Rome-te’ khut sungah ei ap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in thu ei sit zaw ciengun Rome-te in kei ei hla nuom uhi, azieh pen ka thu tawh kisai-in keima in sina dan ka thuoh nading a hang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle Jew mite in ang niel ciengun- ka mipite tungah mawsahna bangma ka nei sih vangin-kumpipa tungah ka thu ka khan lo ang phamaw veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami thu ziehin note tawh kimu-in a kiholim dinga kang khop uh ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile Israel-te’ lametna thu ziehin tam banga siakhau tawh ei kikhi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in, “Judea gam panin nang thu tawh kisai lai bangma ka na nga sih vua, tana ang pei sanggamte koima khat beh in zong nang thu ei ko-in a sie lama ei gen a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin mun zosie-ah tam biehna pawlte’ thu a kigensie hi, ci thei ka hi ziehun, nang tung panin na ngaisutnate ka za nuom uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama tawh a kimu nading uh ni khat a se zaw ciengun Paul zintunna-ah mi tampitah a va haw ta uhi. Ama in zingmawng panin nitah dongin Moses’ thukham le kamsangte’ laibu panin amate thuhil a, Pasien’ manggam thu teci pangin Jesu’ thu lamah amate a thuzaw ding a hanciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama’ thugen ziehin mi pawl khatte in a um vua, hinanle adangte in a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate khatlekhat kithutuoh loin a om uhi. Amate a peikhiet ciengun Paul in thugenna khat neibe lai hi: Kamsang Isaiah tungtawnin na pu na pate uh’ kunga Hlagau Siengtho’ thugen khu a man ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />‘Tam mite kungah pei-in gen in, note in na zah vangun na tel zo ngai sih ding uhi. Note in na et vangun na mucien ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Azieh pen tami mite lungsim a bol a, a bilte un khuo za thei loin, a mit a siing uhi. Tua hi sihle amate in a mit utawh cien mu-in, kei lamah amate hing kihei-in, keima in amate kadam sah ding hi,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gentile-te kungah tami Pasien’ hutdamna thu kipuoh zo hi; amate in a ngai ding uhi,” ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Paul in tam thute a gen zaw ciengin Jew mite pei dawhin amate sungah kiselna nahpi tahin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Paul, kum ni sung vilvel ama le ama kisihin om a, ama kunga a haw mi zosie hoitahin na lamdotin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a lie a dal om loin Pasien’ manggam le Topa Jesu Khris’ thu hangtahin a hil hi.
  </para>
</usx>
